const area: Record<string, Record<string, string>> = {"asp-net-to-typescript-mapping":{"overview":"<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>ASP.NET</th><th>TypeScript</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>DataSourceControl</code> / <code>IDataSource</code></td><td><code>DataSourceControl</code> (abstract), <code>IDataSourceControl</code> (interface)</td><td>Base class: <code>id</code>, 8 events, 4 CRUD methods</td></tr><tr><td><code>DataSourceSelectArguments</code></td><td><code>DataSourceSelectArguments</code></td><td><code>startRowIndex</code>, <code>maximumRows</code>, <code>sortExpression</code>; the total-count members are declared but never used</td></tr><tr><td><code>&lt;asp:SqlDataSource&gt;</code></td><td><code>SqlDataSource</code></td><td>No ADO.NET provider: runs a REST call (<code>fetch</code>) or your <code>handler</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>ConnectionString</code></td><td><code>connectionString</code></td><td>Used as a base URL for the default REST handler</td></tr><tr><td><code>SelectCommand</code> / <code>InsertCommand</code> / <code>UpdateCommand</code> / <code>DeleteCommand</code></td><td><code>selectCommand</code> / <code>insertCommand</code> / <code>updateCommand</code> / <code>deleteCommand</code></td><td>Strings: <code>&quot;METHOD /url/{token}&quot;</code> REST templates, or labels passed to your <code>handler</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>SelectCommandType</code></td><td><code>selectCommandType</code> (<code>&quot;Text&quot; | &quot;StoredProcedure&quot;</code>)</td><td>Stored, never read by any logic</td></tr><tr><td><code>&lt;asp:ObjectDataSource&gt;</code></td><td><code>ObjectDataSource</code></td><td>Calls methods on an object instance instead of reflecting on <code>TypeName</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>TypeName</code></td><td><code>typeName</code></td><td>Stored only, ignored. Use <code>typeInstance</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>SelectMethod</code> / <code>InsertMethod</code> / <code>UpdateMethod</code> / <code>DeleteMethod</code></td><td>same names</td><td>Method name looked up on the instance</td></tr><tr><td><code>EnablePaging</code>, <code>StartRowIndexParameterName</code>, <code>MaximumRowsParameterName</code>, <code>SortParameterName</code></td><td><code>enablePaging</code>, <code>startRowIndexParameterName</code>, <code>maximumRowsParameterName</code>, <code>sortParameterName</code></td><td>Same names and defaults</td></tr><tr><td><code>&lt;asp:AccessDataSource&gt;</code></td><td><code>AccessDataSource</code></td><td>Backed by an in-memory <code>DataTable</code>; <code>dataFilePath</code> is stored but unused</td></tr><tr><td><code>FilterExpression</code> / <code>SortParameterName</code></td><td><code>filterExpression</code> / <code>sortExpression</code></td><td>DataTable filter/sort syntax (see section 7)</td></tr><tr><td><code>&lt;asp:XmlDataSource&gt;</code></td><td><code>XmlDataSource</code></td><td><code>data</code>, <code>dataFile</code>, <code>xPath</code>; read-only; XPath heavily simplified</td></tr><tr><td><code>&lt;asp:SiteMapDataSource&gt;</code></td><td><code>SiteMapDataSource</code></td><td>Takes a <code>SiteMapNode</code> tree; <code>ShowStartingNode</code>, <code>StartingNodeUrl</code> supported</td></tr><tr><td><code>&lt;SelectParameters&gt;</code> etc.</td><td><code>selectParameters</code> / <code>insertParameters</code> / <code>updateParameters</code> / <code>deleteParameters</code></td><td><code>ParameterCollection</code> (Sql and Object only)</td></tr><tr><td><code>Parameter</code> (Name, Type, DefaultValue, Direction, Size)</td><td><code>Parameter</code></td><td><code>ConvertEmptyStringToNull</code> is <strong>not</strong> implemented</td></tr><tr><td><code>ControlParameter</code> (ControlID, PropertyName)</td><td><code>ControlParameter</code> (<code>controlId</code>, <code>propertyName</code>)</td><td>Reads <code>context.controls</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>QueryStringParameter</code> (QueryStringField)</td><td><code>QueryStringParameter</code></td><td>Reads <code>context.queryString</code> or <code>window.location.search</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>SessionParameter</code> (SessionField)</td><td><code>SessionParameter</code></td><td>Reads <code>context.session</code> or <code>sessionStorage</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>FormParameter</code> (FormField)</td><td><code>FormParameter</code></td><td>Reads <code>context.form</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>CookieParameter</code>, <code>ProfileParameter</code>, <code>RouteParameter</code></td><td>not implemented</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>Selecting</code> / <code>Selected</code></td><td><code>selecting</code> / <code>selected</code></td><td><code>EventDispatcher</code> instances</td></tr><tr><td><code>Inserting</code> / <code>Inserted</code>, <code>Updating</code> / <code>Updated</code>, <code>Deleting</code> / <code>Deleted</code></td><td><code>inserting</code> / <code>inserted</code>, ...</td><td><code>-ing</code> events carry <code>cancel</code>; <code>-ed</code> events carry <code>exception</code> / <code>exceptionHandled</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>SqlDataSourceCommandEventArgs.Cancel</code></td><td><code>e.cancel = true</code></td><td>Promise-based; no postback</td></tr><tr><td><code>SqlDataSourceStatusEventArgs.AffectedRows / Exception / ExceptionHandled</code></td><td><code>affectedRows</code>, <code>exception</code>, <code>exceptionHandled</code></td><td>Same semantics</td></tr><tr><td><code>EnableCaching</code>, <code>CacheDuration</code>, <code>CacheExpirationPolicy</code></td><td>not implemented</td><td>No data source caches anything</td></tr><tr><td><code>DataSourceMode</code>, <code>CancelSelectOnNullParameter</code></td><td>not implemented</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<hr>\n"},"quick-start":{"overview":"<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span class=\"code-lang\">ts</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\">Copy</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-ts\"><span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> { <span class=\"tok-t\">SqlDataSource</span>, <span class=\"tok-t\">Parameter</span> } <span class=\"tok-k\">from</span> <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;@wf-controls/core&quot;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> ds = <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">SqlDataSource</span>({\n  id: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Products&quot;</span>,\n  selectCommand: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;SELECT * FROM Products WHERE Category = @cat&quot;</span>,\n  selectParameters: [<span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">Parameter</span>({ name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;cat&quot;</span>, defaultValue: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Hardware&quot;</span> })],\n  handler: <span class=\"tok-k\">async</span> (command, params, operation, selectArgs) =&gt; {\n    console.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(operation, <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;|&quot;</span>, command, <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;|&quot;</span>, <span class=\"tok-t\">JSON</span>.<span class=\"tok-f\">stringify</span>(params), <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;|&quot;</span>, <span class=\"tok-t\">JSON</span>.<span class=\"tok-f\">stringify</span>(selectArgs));\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> [{ id: <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>, name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Hammer&quot;</span> }, { id: <span class=\"tok-n\">2</span>, name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Saw&quot;</span> }];\n  }\n});\n\nds.selected.<span class=\"tok-f\">subscribe</span>((_s, e) =&gt; console.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;selected rows:&quot;</span>, e.totalRowCount));\n<span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> rows = <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">select</span>({ startRowIndex: <span class=\"tok-n\">0</span>, maximumRows: <span class=\"tok-n\">10</span>, sortExpression: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;name DESC&quot;</span> });\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(rows);\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// select | SELECT * FROM Products WHERE Category = @cat | {&quot;cat&quot;:&quot;Hardware&quot;,&quot;startRowIndex&quot;:0,&quot;maximumRows&quot;:10,&quot;sortExpression&quot;:&quot;name DESC&quot;} | {&quot;startRowIndex&quot;:0,&quot;maximumRows&quot;:10,&quot;sortExpression&quot;:&quot;name DESC&quot;}</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// selected rows: 2</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// [ { id: 1, name: 'Hammer' }, { id: 2, name: 'Saw' } ]</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>Every data source is a promise-returning object with <code>select</code>, <code>insert</code>, <code>update</code>, <code>delete</code> plus eight events. Presentation controls (<code>GridViewController</code>, etc.) accept any object satisfying <code>IDataSourceControl</code> as their <code>dataSource</code> and route <code>update</code> / <code>delete</code> to it.</p>\n<hr>\n"},"shared-contracts":{"overview":"<p>Source: <code>data-source.ts</code>. Event base types come from <code>events.ts</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span class=\"code-lang\">ts</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\">Copy</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-ts\"><span class=\"tok-k\">interface</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">CancelEventArgs</span> { cancel: boolean }\n<span class=\"tok-k\">type</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">EventHandler</span>&lt;<span class=\"tok-t\">TSender</span>, <span class=\"tok-t\">TArgs</span>&gt; = (sender: <span class=\"tok-t\">TSender</span>, args: <span class=\"tok-t\">TArgs</span>) =&gt; <span class=\"tok-k\">void</span> | <span class=\"tok-t\">Promise</span>&lt;<span class=\"tok-k\">void</span>&gt;;\n<span class=\"tok-k\">class</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">EventDispatcher</span>&lt;<span class=\"tok-t\">TSender</span>, <span class=\"tok-t\">TArgs</span>&gt; {\n  <span class=\"tok-f\">subscribe</span>(handler): () =&gt; <span class=\"tok-k\">void</span>;      <span class=\"tok-c\">// returns an unsubscribe function</span>\n  <span class=\"tok-f\">emit</span>(sender, args): <span class=\"tok-t\">Promise</span>&lt;<span class=\"tok-k\">void</span>&gt;;   <span class=\"tok-c\">// awaits handlers sequentially, in subscription order</span>\n  <span class=\"tok-f\">clear</span>(): <span class=\"tok-k\">void</span>;                       <span class=\"tok-c\">// remove all handlers</span>\n}</code></pre></div>\n<p>Handlers may be <code>async</code>; the data source awaits each one before continuing. If a handler throws, <code>emit</code> rejects and the exception propagates out of the data source call (for <code>-ing</code> events this aborts the operation; for <code>-ed</code> events it surfaces after the operation already ran).</p>\n","datasourceselectarguments":"<h3 id=\"31-datasourceselectarguments\">3.1 <code>DataSourceSelectArguments</code><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#31-datasourceselectarguments\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>startRowIndex</code></td><td><code>number | undefined</code></td><td>Zero-based index of the first row requested</td></tr><tr><td><code>maximumRows</code></td><td><code>number | undefined</code></td><td>Page size</td></tr><tr><td><code>sortExpression</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td>Sort expression such as <code>&quot;name DESC&quot;</code> or <code>&quot;a, b DESC&quot;</code> (interpretation is source-specific)</td></tr><tr><td><code>retrieveTotalRowCount</code></td><td><code>boolean | undefined</code></td><td>Declared only. <strong>Never read or written by any data source</strong></td></tr><tr><td><code>totalRowCount</code></td><td><code>number | undefined</code></td><td>Declared only. <strong>Never written by any data source</strong>; use <code>selected</code> event <code>totalRowCount</code> instead</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n","event-argument-types":"<h3 id=\"32-event-argument-types\">3.2 Event argument types<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#32-event-argument-types\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Type</th><th>Members</th><th>Extends</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>DataSourceSelectingEventArgs</code></td><td><code>arguments: DataSourceSelectArguments</code>, <code>parameters: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;</code>, <code>cancel: boolean</code></td><td><code>CancelEventArgs</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>DataSourceSelectedEventArgs</code></td><td><code>data: unknown</code>, <code>totalRowCount?: number | undefined</code></td><td>(none; not cancellable)</td></tr><tr><td><code>DataSourceInsertingEventArgs</code></td><td><code>values: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;</code>, <code>cancel: boolean</code></td><td><code>CancelEventArgs</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>DataSourceInsertedEventArgs</code></td><td><code>affectedRows: number</code>, <code>returnValue?: unknown</code>, <code>exception?: Error | undefined</code>, <code>exceptionHandled: boolean</code></td><td>none</td></tr><tr><td><code>DataSourceUpdatingEventArgs</code></td><td><code>keys</code>, <code>values</code>, <code>oldValues?: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt; | undefined</code>, <code>cancel: boolean</code></td><td><code>CancelEventArgs</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>DataSourceUpdatedEventArgs</code></td><td><code>affectedRows</code>, <code>returnValue?</code>, <code>exception?</code>, <code>exceptionHandled</code></td><td>none</td></tr><tr><td><code>DataSourceDeletingEventArgs</code></td><td><code>keys</code>, <code>oldValues?</code>, <code>cancel: boolean</code></td><td><code>CancelEventArgs</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>DataSourceDeletedEventArgs</code></td><td><code>affectedRows</code>, <code>returnValue?</code>, <code>exception?</code>, <code>exceptionHandled</code></td><td>none</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n","idatasourcecontrol":"<h3 id=\"33-idatasourcecontrol\">3.3 <code>IDataSourceControl</code><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#33-idatasourcecontrol\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Member</th><th>Type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>readonly id</code></td><td><code>string</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>readonly selecting</code> / <code>selected</code> / <code>inserting</code> / <code>inserted</code> / <code>updating</code> / <code>updated</code> / <code>deleting</code> / <code>deleted</code></td><td><code>EventDispatcher&lt;this, ...EventArgs&gt;</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>select(selectArgs?)</code></td><td><code>Promise&lt;unknown&gt;</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>insert(values)</code></td><td><code>Promise&lt;number&gt;</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>update(keys, values, oldValues?)</code></td><td><code>Promise&lt;number&gt;</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>delete(keys, oldValues?)</code></td><td><code>Promise&lt;number&gt;</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n","datasourcecontrol-abstract-class-implements-idatasourcecontrol":"<h3 id=\"34-datasourcecontrol-abstract-class-implements-idatasourcecontrol\">3.4 <code>DataSourceControl</code> (abstract class, implements <code>IDataSourceControl</code>)<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#34-datasourcecontrol-abstract-class-implements-idatasourcecontrol\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>ASP.NET equivalent:</strong> <code>System.Web.UI.DataSourceControl</code>.</p>\n<p><strong>Constructor</strong></p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>id</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>(required)</td><td>Stored in <code>id</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p><strong>Properties</strong></p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>R/W</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>id</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>read-only</td><td>constructor value</td><td>Identifier; used in error messages</td></tr><tr><td><code>parameterContext</code></td><td><code>ParameterContext | undefined</code></td><td>read/write</td><td><code>undefined</code></td><td>Context passed to <code>Parameter.getValue()</code> when parameters are evaluated (Sql and Object sources only)</td></tr><tr><td><code>selecting</code>, <code>selected</code>, <code>inserting</code>, <code>inserted</code>, <code>updating</code>, <code>updated</code>, <code>deleting</code>, <code>deleted</code></td><td><code>EventDispatcher&lt;this, ...&gt;</code></td><td>read-only</td><td>new dispatcher each</td><td>See events table</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p><strong>Methods</strong></p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Signature</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>abstract select(selectArgs?: DataSourceSelectArguments): Promise&lt;unknown&gt;</code></td><td>Read rows</td></tr><tr><td><code>abstract insert(values: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;): Promise&lt;number&gt;</code></td><td>Returns affected row count</td></tr><tr><td><code>abstract update(keys, values, oldValues?): Promise&lt;number&gt;</code></td><td>Returns affected row count</td></tr><tr><td><code>abstract delete(keys, oldValues?): Promise&lt;number&gt;</code></td><td>Returns affected row count</td></tr><tr><td><code>protected evaluateParameters(params: ParameterCollection): Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;</code></td><td>Returns <code>params.evaluate(this.parameterContext)</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p><strong>Events</strong> (common to all subclasses; per-class differences are noted in each section)</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Event</th><th>Args</th><th>Cancellable</th><th>Raised</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>selecting</code></td><td><code>DataSourceSelectingEventArgs</code></td><td>Yes (<code>cancel</code>); <code>select()</code> then returns <code>[]</code></td><td>Before the select executes</td></tr><tr><td><code>selected</code></td><td><code>DataSourceSelectedEventArgs</code></td><td>No</td><td>After a successful select</td></tr><tr><td><code>inserting</code></td><td><code>DataSourceInsertingEventArgs</code></td><td>Yes; <code>insert()</code> returns <code>0</code></td><td>Before insert</td></tr><tr><td><code>inserted</code></td><td><code>DataSourceInsertedEventArgs</code></td><td>No</td><td>After insert (see per-class)</td></tr><tr><td><code>updating</code></td><td><code>DataSourceUpdatingEventArgs</code></td><td>Yes; <code>update()</code> returns <code>0</code></td><td>Before update</td></tr><tr><td><code>updated</code></td><td><code>DataSourceUpdatedEventArgs</code></td><td>No</td><td>After update</td></tr><tr><td><code>deleting</code></td><td><code>DataSourceDeletingEventArgs</code></td><td>Yes; <code>delete()</code> returns <code>0</code></td><td>Before delete</td></tr><tr><td><code>deleted</code></td><td><code>DataSourceDeletedEventArgs</code></td><td>No</td><td>After delete</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<hr>\n"},"parameters":{"overview":"<p>Source: <code>parameter.ts</code>.</p>\n","types":"<h3 id=\"41-types\">4.1 Types<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#41-types\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span class=\"code-lang\">ts</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\">Copy</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-ts\"><span class=\"tok-k\">type</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">ParameterType</span> = <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;String&quot;</span> | <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Int32&quot;</span> | <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Decimal&quot;</span> | <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Double&quot;</span> | <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Boolean&quot;</span> | <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;DateTime&quot;</span> | <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Object&quot;</span>;\n<span class=\"tok-k\">type</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">ParameterDirection</span> = <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Input&quot;</span> | <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Output&quot;</span> | <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;InputOutput&quot;</span> | <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;ReturnValue&quot;</span>;</code></pre></div>\n<p><code>ParameterDirection</code> and <code>size</code> are stored on the parameter but <strong>no data source reads them</strong>.</p>\n","parametercontext":"<h3 id=\"42-parametercontext\">4.2 <code>ParameterContext</code><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#42-parametercontext\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<p>The runtime &quot;page&quot; a parameter reads from. Assign it to <code>dataSource.parameterContext</code>.</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>Type</th><th>Used by</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>controls</code></td><td><code>Record&lt;string, unknown | (() =&gt; unknown)&gt; | undefined</code></td><td><code>ControlParameter</code></td><td>Map of control id to a getter function, an object with properties, or a plain value</td></tr><tr><td><code>queryString</code></td><td><code>string | URLSearchParams | Record&lt;string, string&gt; | undefined</code></td><td><code>QueryStringParameter</code></td><td>Query string text (leading <code>?</code> allowed), <code>URLSearchParams</code>, or a plain object</td></tr><tr><td><code>session</code></td><td><code>Record&lt;string, unknown&gt; | Storage | undefined</code></td><td><code>SessionParameter</code></td><td>Plain object or any object with <code>getItem()</code> (e.g. <code>sessionStorage</code>)</td></tr><tr><td><code>form</code></td><td><code>Record&lt;string, unknown&gt; | FormData | undefined</code></td><td><code>FormParameter</code></td><td>Plain object or any object with <code>get()</code> (e.g. <code>FormData</code>)</td></tr><tr><td><code>[key: string]</code></td><td><code>unknown</code></td><td>(custom)</td><td>Index signature; nothing in core reads extra keys</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n","parameteroptions":"<h3 id=\"43-parameteroptions\">4.3 <code>ParameterOptions</code><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#43-parameteroptions\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>name</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>(required)</td><td>Key in the evaluated parameter bag</td></tr><tr><td><code>type</code></td><td><code>ParameterType | undefined</code></td><td><code>&quot;String&quot;</code></td><td>Coercion target</td></tr><tr><td><code>defaultValue</code></td><td><code>unknown</code></td><td><code>undefined</code></td><td>Used when no value is found</td></tr><tr><td><code>direction</code></td><td><code>ParameterDirection | undefined</code></td><td><code>&quot;Input&quot;</code></td><td>Stored only</td></tr><tr><td><code>size</code></td><td><code>number | undefined</code></td><td><code>undefined</code></td><td>Stored only</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n","parameter":"<h3 id=\"44-parameter\">4.4 <code>Parameter</code><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#44-parameter\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>ASP.NET equivalent:</strong> <code>System.Web.UI.WebControls.Parameter</code>.</p>\n<p><strong>Constructor</strong> <code>new Parameter(options: ParameterOptions | string, defaultValue?: unknown)</code></p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>options</code></td><td><code>ParameterOptions | string</code></td><td>(required)</td><td>A string is the <code>name</code>; type becomes <code>&quot;String&quot;</code>, direction <code>&quot;Input&quot;</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>defaultValue</code></td><td><code>unknown</code></td><td><code>undefined</code></td><td>Only honoured in the string form (<code>new Parameter(&quot;flag&quot;, &quot;x&quot;)</code>); ignored when an options object is passed</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p><strong>Properties</strong></p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>R/W</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>name</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>read-only</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>type</code></td><td><code>ParameterType</code></td><td>read-only</td><td><code>&quot;String&quot;</code></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>defaultValue</code></td><td><code>unknown</code></td><td>read-only</td><td><code>undefined</code></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>direction</code></td><td><code>ParameterDirection</code></td><td>read-only</td><td><code>&quot;Input&quot;</code></td><td>Not used</td></tr><tr><td><code>size</code></td><td><code>number | undefined</code></td><td>read-only</td><td><code>undefined</code></td><td>Not used</td></tr><tr><td><code>value</code></td><td><code>unknown</code></td><td>read/write</td><td><code>undefined</code></td><td>Explicit value. When not <code>undefined</code> it wins over everything (all subclasses check it first)</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p><strong>Methods</strong></p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Signature</th><th>Returns</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>getValue(context?: ParameterContext): unknown</code></td><td>coerced value</td><td>Base class: <code>value</code> if not <code>undefined</code>, else <code>defaultValue</code>, then coerced. <strong>The context is ignored</strong></td></tr><tr><td><code>protected coerceValue(val: unknown): unknown</code></td><td>coerced value</td><td>See coercion rules below</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p><strong>Coercion rules</strong> (<code>coerceValue</code>; <code>null</code> and <code>undefined</code> pass through unchanged):</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th><code>type</code></th><th>Behaviour</th><th>Verified</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>&quot;Int32&quot;</code></td><td><code>parseInt(String(v), 10)</code>; if <code>NaN</code>, the <strong>original value</strong> is returned unchanged</td><td><code>&quot;12abc&quot;</code> -&gt; <code>12</code>, <code>&quot;abc&quot;</code> -&gt; <code>&quot;abc&quot;</code>, <code>&quot;&quot;</code> -&gt; <code>&quot;&quot;</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>&quot;Decimal&quot;</code>, <code>&quot;Double&quot;</code></td><td><code>parseFloat(String(v))</code>; <code>NaN</code> returns original</td><td><code>&quot;1.5&quot;</code> -&gt; <code>1.5</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>&quot;Boolean&quot;</code></td><td>booleans pass; otherwise <code>String(v).trim().toLowerCase()</code> is <code>true</code> only for <code>&quot;true&quot;</code>, <code>&quot;1&quot;</code>, <code>&quot;yes&quot;</code></td><td><code>&quot;no&quot;</code> -&gt; <code>false</code>, <code>&quot;1&quot;</code> -&gt; <code>true</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>&quot;DateTime&quot;</code></td><td><code>Date</code> instances pass; otherwise <code>new Date(String(v))</code>, invalid returns original</td><td><code>&quot;garbage&quot;</code> -&gt; <code>&quot;garbage&quot;</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>&quot;String&quot;</code></td><td><code>String(v)</code></td><td><code>5</code> -&gt; <code>&quot;5&quot;</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>&quot;Object&quot;</code></td><td>unchanged</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>There is no <code>ConvertEmptyStringToNull</code>: <code>&quot;&quot;</code> stays <code>&quot;&quot;</code> (and an empty string for <code>Int32</code> stays <code>&quot;&quot;</code> because <code>parseInt(&quot;&quot;)</code> is <code>NaN</code>). Null-valued parameters are still sent (<code>null</code>), not dropped. In the default REST handler a GET query string omits <code>null</code> / <code>undefined</code> values.</p>\n","controlparameter-extends-parameter":"<h3 id=\"45-controlparameter-extends-parameter\">4.5 <code>ControlParameter</code> (extends <code>Parameter</code>)<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#45-controlparameter-extends-parameter\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>ASP.NET equivalent:</strong> <code>ControlParameter</code> (<code>ControlID</code>, <code>PropertyName</code>).</p>\n<p>Extra options (<code>ControlParameterOptions</code>):</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>controlId</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>(required)</td><td>Key in <code>context.controls</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>propertyName</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td><code>&quot;value&quot;</code></td><td>Property read from the control object</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>Properties: <code>controlId: string</code> (read-only), <code>propertyName: string</code> (read-only).</p>\n<p><code>getValue(context)</code> resolution order:</p>\n<ol><li><code>this.value</code> if not <code>undefined</code>.</li><li><p>If <code>context.controls</code> has an entry for <code>controlId</code> (not <code>undefined</code>):</p>\n<ul><li>entry is a <strong>function</strong>: its return value;</li><li>entry is a non-null <strong>object</strong> containing <code>propertyName</code> (<code>in</code> check): that property's value (called if it is a function);</li><li>otherwise: the entry itself is the value (e.g. a string).</li></ul></li><li><code>defaultValue</code>.</li></ol>\n<p>The result of each step is coerced to <code>type</code>. A missing control and a missing context both fall through to the default (<code>undefined</code> when none).</p>\n","querystringparameter-extends-parameter":"<h3 id=\"46-querystringparameter-extends-parameter\">4.6 <code>QueryStringParameter</code> (extends <code>Parameter</code>)<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#46-querystringparameter-extends-parameter\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<p>Extra option: <code>queryStringField: string</code> (required; read-only property of the same name).</p>\n<p><code>getValue(context)</code> order:</p>\n<ol><li><code>this.value</code>.</li><li>If <code>context.queryString</code> is <strong>truthy</strong>: <code>URLSearchParams</code> is used directly; a <code>string</code> is parsed (one leading <code>?</code> stripped); a plain object is read as <code>obj[queryStringField]</code> (a hit returns immediately).</li><li>Otherwise (no / empty context query string) in a browser (<code>window</code> defined and <code>window.location.search</code> non-empty): <code>window.location.search</code> is parsed. Not exercised in Node.</li><li>If a <code>URLSearchParams</code> was obtained and <code>get(field)</code> is not <code>null</code>: that value.</li><li><code>defaultValue</code>.</li></ol>\n<p>Gotcha: once <code>context.queryString</code> is truthy, the browser URL is <strong>not</strong> consulted as a fallback. An empty string <code>&quot;&quot;</code> is falsy, so it does fall back to the URL. Values are always strings before coercion.</p>\n","sessionparameter-extends-parameter":"<h3 id=\"47-sessionparameter-extends-parameter\">4.7 <code>SessionParameter</code> (extends <code>Parameter</code>)<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#47-sessionparameter-extends-parameter\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<p>Extra option: <code>sessionField: string</code> (required; read-only property).</p>\n<p>Order: <code>this.value</code>; if <code>context.session</code> is set: an object with a <code>getItem</code> function is queried with <code>getItem(sessionField)</code> (non-<code>null</code> wins), otherwise a plain object is checked with <code>sessionField in session</code>; if no context session, <code>sessionStorage.getItem(sessionField)</code> is used when <code>sessionStorage</code> exists (browser only); else <code>defaultValue</code>. Note: when a context session is provided, <code>sessionStorage</code> is not consulted.</p>\n","formparameter-extends-parameter":"<h3 id=\"48-formparameter-extends-parameter\">4.8 <code>FormParameter</code> (extends <code>Parameter</code>)<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#48-formparameter-extends-parameter\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<p>Extra option: <code>formField: string</code> (required; read-only property).</p>\n<p>Order: <code>this.value</code>; if <code>context.form</code> is set: an object with a <code>get</code> function (<code>FormData</code>) uses <code>get(formField)</code> (non-<code>null</code> wins); otherwise a plain object is checked with <code>formField in form</code>; else <code>defaultValue</code>. There is no browser/DOM fallback. A <code>Map</code> would also be treated as FormData-like because it has <code>get</code>.</p>\n","parametercollection-implements-iterable":"<h3 id=\"49-parametercollection-implements-iterable\">4.9 <code>ParameterCollection</code> (implements <code>Iterable&lt;Parameter&gt;</code>)<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#49-parametercollection-implements-iterable\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>ASP.NET equivalent:</strong> <code>ParameterCollection</code>.</p>\n<p><strong>Constructor</strong> <code>new ParameterCollection(parameters?: Parameter[])</code>: adds each parameter.</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Member</th><th>Signature / Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>count</code></td><td><code>number</code> (read-only)</td><td>Number of parameters</td></tr><tr><td><code>add</code></td><td><code>add(parameter: Parameter): Parameter</code></td><td>Adds, replacing any existing parameter with the same <code>name</code>; returns it</td></tr><tr><td><code>add</code></td><td><code>add(name: string, value: unknown): Parameter</code></td><td>Creates <code>new Parameter(name, value)</code> and (if <code>value !== undefined</code>) also sets <code>.value = value</code>; returns it</td></tr><tr><td><code>get</code></td><td><code>get(name: string): Parameter | undefined</code></td><td>Lookup by name</td></tr><tr><td><code>has</code></td><td><code>has(name: string): boolean</code></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>remove</code></td><td><code>remove(name: string): boolean</code></td><td><code>true</code> if something was removed</td></tr><tr><td><code>clear</code></td><td><code>clear(): void</code></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>evaluate</code></td><td><code>evaluate(context?: ParameterContext): Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;</code></td><td><code>{ [name]: param.getValue(context) }</code> for all parameters, in insertion order. Includes entries whose value is <code>undefined</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>toArray</code></td><td><code>toArray(): Parameter[]</code></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>[Symbol.iterator]</code></td><td></td><td>Iterates parameters</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>Both overloads throw nothing.</p>\n","how-parameter-binding-works":"<h3 id=\"410-how-parameter-binding-works\">4.10 How parameter binding works<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#410-how-parameter-binding-works\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<ol><li>A data source holds up to four <code>ParameterCollection</code>s (<code>selectParameters</code>, <code>insertParameters</code>, <code>updateParameters</code>, <code>deleteParameters</code>); <code>SqlDataSource</code> and <code>ObjectDataSource</code> only. Passing an array wraps it in a new collection; passing a <code>ParameterCollection</code> instance uses that instance as-is (shared by reference).</li><li>On each operation the source calls <code>evaluateParameters(collection)</code>, i.e. <code>collection.evaluate(this.parameterContext)</code>. Parameters are re-evaluated on every call, so changing control values, <code>parameter.value</code>, or the context is picked up immediately.</li><li>The evaluated bag is merged with call data (later spreads win):</li></ol>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Operation</th><th>Merge order (last wins)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>select</code></td><td>evaluated parameters; then <code>startRowIndex</code> / <code>maximumRows</code> / <code>sortExpression</code> from <code>selectArgs</code> (rules differ per class)</td></tr><tr><td><code>insert</code></td><td><code>{ ...insertParameters, ...values }</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>update</code></td><td><code>{ ...updateParameters, ...oldValues, ...keys, ...values }</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>delete</code></td><td><code>{ ...deleteParameters, ...oldValues, ...keys }</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<ol start=\"4\"><li>For select, the <code>selecting</code> event receives the bag as <code>e.parameters</code> (mutable; handlers can add or change entries and the changed bag is what executes). For insert and update, <code>e.values</code> is the merged bag (mutable, executes). For delete, the merged bag is <strong>not</strong> exposed; see the per-class notes.</li></ol>\n<hr>\n"},"sqldatasource":{"overview":"<p>Source: <code>sql-data-source.ts</code>. Extends <code>DataSourceControl</code>.</p>\n<p><strong>ASP.NET equivalent:</strong> <code>SqlDataSource</code>. There is no database access: a command is either routed to your <code>handler</code>, or interpreted by the built-in REST handler using <code>fetch</code>.</p>\n","types":"<h3 id=\"51-types\">5.1 Types<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#51-types\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span class=\"code-lang\">ts</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\">Copy</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-ts\"><span class=\"tok-k\">type</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">SqlCommandOperation</span> = <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;select&quot;</span> | <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;insert&quot;</span> | <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;update&quot;</span> | <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;delete&quot;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">type</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">SqlCommandHandler</span> = (\n  command: string,\n  parameters: <span class=\"tok-t\">Record</span>&lt;string, unknown&gt;,\n  operation: <span class=\"tok-t\">SqlCommandOperation</span>,\n  selectArgs?: <span class=\"tok-t\">DataSourceSelectArguments</span>\n) =&gt; <span class=\"tok-t\">Promise</span>&lt;unknown&gt;;</code></pre></div>\n","constructor-new-sqldatasource-options-sqldatasourceoptions":"<h3 id=\"52-constructor-new-sqldatasourceoptions-sqldatasourceoptions\">5.2 Constructor: <code>new SqlDataSource(options: SqlDataSourceOptions)</code><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#52-constructor-new-sqldatasourceoptions-sqldatasourceoptions\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Option</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>id</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>(required)</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>connectionString</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td><code>undefined</code></td><td>Base URL for the REST handler (not used when <code>handler</code> is set)</td></tr><tr><td><code>selectCommand</code> / <code>insertCommand</code> / <code>updateCommand</code> / <code>deleteCommand</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td><code>undefined</code></td><td>An operation without its command throws</td></tr><tr><td><code>selectCommandType</code></td><td><code>&quot;Text&quot; | &quot;StoredProcedure&quot; | undefined</code></td><td><code>&quot;Text&quot;</code></td><td>Stored only</td></tr><tr><td><code>selectParameters</code> / <code>insertParameters</code> / <code>updateParameters</code> / <code>deleteParameters</code></td><td><code>Parameter[] | ParameterCollection | undefined</code></td><td>empty collection</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>handler</code></td><td><code>SqlCommandHandler | undefined</code></td><td><code>undefined</code></td><td>Replaces the REST handler entirely</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n","properties":"<h3 id=\"53-properties\">5.3 Properties<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#53-properties\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>R/W</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>connectionString</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td>rw</td><td>from options</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>selectCommand</code>, <code>insertCommand</code>, <code>updateCommand</code>, <code>deleteCommand</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td>rw</td><td>from options</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>selectCommandType</code></td><td><code>&quot;Text&quot; | &quot;StoredProcedure&quot;</code></td><td>rw</td><td><code>&quot;Text&quot;</code></td><td>No effect</td></tr><tr><td><code>selectParameters</code>, <code>insertParameters</code>, <code>updateParameters</code>, <code>deleteParameters</code></td><td><code>ParameterCollection</code></td><td>read-only reference</td><td></td><td>Mutate via collection methods</td></tr><tr><td><code>handler</code></td><td><code>SqlCommandHandler | undefined</code></td><td>rw</td><td>from options</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>plus everything inherited from <code>DataSourceControl</code> (<code>id</code>, <code>parameterContext</code>, events)</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n","methods":"<h3 id=\"54-methods\">5.4 Methods<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#54-methods\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Signature</th><th>Returns</th><th>Throws</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>select(selectArgs: DataSourceSelectArguments = {})</code></td><td><code>Promise&lt;unknown&gt;</code> (whatever the handler/REST returned)</td><td><code>Error(&quot;SqlDataSource '&lt;id&gt;' has no selectCommand configured.&quot;)</code>; anything the handler / <code>fetch</code> throws (<strong>not</strong> wrapped, no <code>selected</code> event)</td><td>See flow below</td></tr><tr><td><code>insert(values: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;)</code></td><td><code>Promise&lt;number&gt;</code></td><td><code>Error(&quot;... no insertCommand configured.&quot;)</code> (before any event); handler error unless <code>exceptionHandled</code></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>update(keys, values, oldValues?)</code></td><td><code>Promise&lt;number&gt;</code></td><td><code>Error(&quot;... no updateCommand configured.&quot;)</code>; handler error unless handled</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>delete(keys, oldValues?)</code></td><td><code>Promise&lt;number&gt;</code></td><td><code>Error(&quot;... no deleteCommand configured.&quot;)</code>; handler error unless handled</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p><strong>select flow</strong></p>\n<ol><li>Evaluate <code>selectParameters</code> with <code>parameterContext</code>.</li><li>If <code>selectArgs.startRowIndex</code> / <code>maximumRows</code> / <code>sortExpression</code> is defined <strong>and</strong> the parameter bag has no defined entry of that name, it is added under the keys <code>&quot;startRowIndex&quot;</code>, <code>&quot;maximumRows&quot;</code>, <code>&quot;sortExpression&quot;</code> (fixed names; a parameter you declared with the same name takes precedence, verified).</li><li>Emit <code>selecting</code> (<code>arguments</code>, <code>parameters</code>, <code>cancel</code>). If <code>cancel</code>, return <code>[]</code> (no <code>selected</code>).</li><li>Execute with <code>selectingArgs.parameters</code> and the original <code>selectArgs</code>.</li><li>Compute <code>totalRowCount</code>: <code>data.length</code> if an array; else <code>Number(data.total)</code> if <code>data</code> is an object with a <code>total</code> key; else <code>undefined</code>.</li><li>Emit <code>selected</code> (<code>{ data, totalRowCount }</code>) and return <code>data</code> unchanged (no unwrapping of <code>{ total, rows }</code>).</li></ol>\n<p><strong>insert / update / delete flow</strong></p>\n<ol><li>Merge parameters (section 4.10). 2. Emit the <code>-ing</code> event; <code>cancel</code> returns <code>0</code>. 3. Execute inside <code>try/catch</code>; <code>affectedRows = typeof returnValue === &quot;number&quot; ? returnValue : 1</code>; on error <code>affectedRows</code> stays <code>0</code> and the error (non-<code>Error</code> throws are wrapped in <code>Error(String(err))</code>) is captured. 4. Emit the <code>-ed</code> event with <code>{ affectedRows, returnValue, exception, exceptionHandled: false }</code>. 5. If an exception was captured and no handler set <code>e.exceptionHandled = true</code>, it is rethrown; otherwise the method returns <code>affectedRows</code>.</li></ol>\n<p>Per-operation specifics:</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th></th><th><code>inserting</code> args</th><th><code>updating</code> args</th><th><code>deleting</code> args</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>values</code></td><td>merged bag (mutations are executed)</td><td>merged bag (mutations are executed)</td><td>n/a</td></tr><tr><td><code>keys</code></td><td>n/a</td><td>the caller's object</td><td>the caller's object</td></tr><tr><td><code>oldValues</code></td><td>n/a</td><td>caller's value</td><td>caller's value</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>Gotcha: <code>deleting</code> has no parameter bag, so a <code>deleting</code> handler cannot change what is sent; changing <code>e.keys</code> does not affect the executed delete in <code>SqlDataSource</code> (contrast with <code>ObjectDataSource</code>, where <code>deleting.keys</code> is the object passed to the method). Also <code>updating.keys</code> mutations do not affect execution; only <code>e.values</code> does.</p>\n","events":"<h3 id=\"55-events\">5.5 Events<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#55-events\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Event</th><th>Args</th><th>Cancellable</th><th>Raised</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>selecting</code></td><td><code>DataSourceSelectingEventArgs</code></td><td>Yes (<code>select</code> returns <code>[]</code>)</td><td>After parameters/paging bag is built, before execute</td></tr><tr><td><code>selected</code></td><td><code>DataSourceSelectedEventArgs</code></td><td>No</td><td>After successful execute; not raised on cancel or error</td></tr><tr><td><code>inserting</code> / <code>updating</code> / <code>deleting</code></td><td>respective args</td><td>Yes (<code>0</code> returned)</td><td>Before execute</td></tr><tr><td><code>inserted</code> / <code>updated</code> / <code>deleted</code></td><td>respective args</td><td>No</td><td>After execute, <strong>also when it failed</strong> (<code>exception</code> set, <code>affectedRows</code> 0)</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n","the-default-rest-handler-adapter-contract":"<h3 id=\"56-the-default-rest-handler-adapter-contract\">5.6 The default REST handler (adapter contract)<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#56-the-default-rest-handler-adapter-contract\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<p>Used only when <code>handler</code> is unset. It uses the global <code>fetch</code>; if no <code>fetch</code> exists it throws <code>&quot;No fetch implementation or SqlCommandHandler provided for SqlDataSource.&quot;</code>.</p>\n<p><strong>Command grammar.</strong> <code>command.trim()</code> is matched against <code>^([A-Z]+)\\s+(.+)$</code> (case-insensitive). On a match the first word is the HTTP method (uppercased) and the rest is the URL template. Otherwise the whole string is the URL and the method comes from the operation: select <code>GET</code>, insert <code>POST</code>, update <code>PUT</code>, delete <code>DELETE</code>.</p>\n<p>Gotcha: any command that starts with a word followed by whitespace is treated as <code>METHOD url</code>. A real SQL string like <code>&quot;SELECT * FROM T&quot;</code> becomes method <code>SELECT</code> with URL <code>* FROM T</code> (verified: <code>SELECT https://h/* FROM T</code>). When using SQL text, always supply a <code>handler</code>.</p>\n<p><strong>URL building</strong></p>\n<ol><li>Every <code>{token}</code> (letters, digits, <code>_</code>) is replaced by <code>encodeURIComponent(String(parameters[token]))</code> and that parameter is marked as consumed. A token with no matching parameter key is replaced by an empty string (<code>/items/{missing}/x</code> -&gt; <code>/items//x</code>).</li><li>If <code>connectionString</code> is set: trailing <code>/</code> removed from it, a leading <code>/</code> ensured on the URL, and they are concatenated. A URL that is already absolute (e.g. <code>http://x/y</code>) with a <code>connectionString</code> set would still be prefixed; leave <code>connectionString</code> unset for absolute URLs.</li><li><strong>GET</strong>: remaining (unconsumed) parameters with non-<code>null</code>, non-<code>undefined</code> values are appended as a query string (<code>?</code> or <code>&amp;</code>, via <code>URLSearchParams</code>), including the injected <code>startRowIndex</code>, <code>maximumRows</code>, <code>sortExpression</code>.</li><li><strong>Other methods</strong>: remaining parameters (including <code>null</code>) are sent as a JSON body (<code>Content-Type: application/json</code>); consumed URL tokens are excluded. A DELETE with only a token still sends <code>{}</code>.</li><li>Headers: <code>Accept: application/json</code>.</li></ol>\n<p><strong>Response handling:</strong> non-2xx throws <code>Error(&quot;HTTP error &lt;status&gt;: &lt;statusText&gt;&quot;)</code>; status <code>204</code> returns <code>1</code>; otherwise the body text is <code>JSON.parse</code>d, and an empty body returns <code>1</code>. A non-JSON body throws a <code>SyntaxError</code>. Return a number from your API for insert/update/delete if you want it used as <code>affectedRows</code>; any other JSON (e.g. <code>{ id: 3 }</code>) yields <code>affectedRows = 1</code>.</p>\n","caching":"<h3 id=\"57-caching\">5.7 Caching<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#57-caching\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<p>None. Every <code>select()</code> calls the handler / <code>fetch</code> again.</p>\n<hr>\n"},"objectdatasource":{"overview":"<p>Source: <code>object-data-source.ts</code>. Extends <code>DataSourceControl</code>.</p>\n<p><strong>ASP.NET equivalent:</strong> <code>ObjectDataSource</code>. Instead of reflecting on a type name, you give it an object (or a factory) and method names.</p>\n","types":"<h3 id=\"61-types\">6.1 Types<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#61-types\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span class=\"code-lang\">ts</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\">Copy</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-ts\"><span class=\"tok-k\">type</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">ObjectInstanceResolver</span> = object | (() =&gt; object | <span class=\"tok-t\">Promise</span>&lt;object&gt;);</code></pre></div>\n<p>A <strong>function</strong> value is always treated as a factory and called on every operation (<code>await</code>ed); anything else is used as the instance. Consequently you cannot pass a class constructor (it would be called without <code>new</code>, throwing for ES classes); pass an instance or <code>() =&gt; new Service()</code>.</p>\n","constructor-new-objectdatasource-options-objectdatasourceoptions":"<h3 id=\"62-constructor-new-objectdatasourceoptions-objectdatasourceoptions\">6.2 Constructor: <code>new ObjectDataSource(options: ObjectDataSourceOptions)</code><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#62-constructor-new-objectdatasourceoptions-objectdatasourceoptions\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Option</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>id</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>(required)</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>typeName</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td><code>undefined</code></td><td>Stored only; ignored</td></tr><tr><td><code>typeInstance</code></td><td><code>ObjectInstanceResolver | undefined</code></td><td><code>undefined</code></td><td>Required at operation time</td></tr><tr><td><code>selectMethod</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>(required)</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>insertMethod</code>, <code>updateMethod</code>, <code>deleteMethod</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td><code>undefined</code></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>selectParameters</code>, <code>insertParameters</code>, <code>updateParameters</code>, <code>deleteParameters</code></td><td><code>Parameter[] | ParameterCollection | undefined</code></td><td>empty collection</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>enablePaging</code></td><td><code>boolean | undefined</code></td><td><code>false</code></td><td>Whether <code>startRowIndex</code> / <code>maximumRows</code> are added to the parameter bag</td></tr><tr><td><code>startRowIndexParameterName</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td><code>&quot;startRowIndex&quot;</code></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>maximumRowsParameterName</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td><code>&quot;maximumRows&quot;</code></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>sortParameterName</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td><code>&quot;sortExpression&quot;</code></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n","properties-all-read-write-except-the-collections":"<h3 id=\"63-properties-all-readwrite-except-the-collections\">6.3 Properties (all read/write except the collections)<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#63-properties-all-readwrite-except-the-collections\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>typeName</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td>from options</td></tr><tr><td><code>typeInstance</code></td><td><code>ObjectInstanceResolver | undefined</code></td><td>from options</td></tr><tr><td><code>selectMethod</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>from options</td></tr><tr><td><code>insertMethod</code>, <code>updateMethod</code>, <code>deleteMethod</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td>from options</td></tr><tr><td><code>selectParameters</code>, <code>insertParameters</code>, <code>updateParameters</code>, <code>deleteParameters</code> (read-only refs)</td><td><code>ParameterCollection</code></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>enablePaging</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>false</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>startRowIndexParameterName</code>, <code>maximumRowsParameterName</code>, <code>sortParameterName</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>see above</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n","methods-and-the-method-call-contract":"<h3 id=\"64-methods-and-the-method-call-contract\">6.4 Methods and the method-call contract<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#64-methods-and-the-method-call-contract\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Signature</th><th>Returns</th><th>Throws</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>select(selectArgs: DataSourceSelectArguments = {})</code></td><td><code>Promise&lt;unknown&gt;</code></td><td><code>&quot;ObjectDataSource '&lt;id&gt;' has no typeInstance configured.&quot;</code>; <code>&quot;Method '&lt;name&gt;' not found on typeInstance for ObjectDataSource '&lt;id&gt;'.&quot;</code>; anything the method throws (not wrapped, no <code>selected</code>). These are thrown <strong>after</strong> <code>selecting</code> is raised</td></tr><tr><td><code>insert(values)</code></td><td><code>Promise&lt;number&gt;</code></td><td><code>&quot;... has no insertMethod configured.&quot;</code> (before events); instance/method errors and method exceptions are captured into <code>inserted</code> and rethrown unless <code>exceptionHandled</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>update(keys, values, oldValues?)</code></td><td><code>Promise&lt;number&gt;</code></td><td><code>&quot;... has no updateMethod configured.&quot;</code>; rest as insert</td></tr><tr><td><code>delete(keys, oldValues?)</code></td><td><code>Promise&lt;number&gt;</code></td><td><code>&quot;... has no deleteMethod configured.&quot;</code>; rest as insert</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Operation</th><th>Method invoked as (with <code>this</code> = instance)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>select</td><td><code>instance[selectMethod](parameters, selectArgs)</code></td></tr><tr><td>insert</td><td><code>instance[insertMethod](values)</code> where <code>values</code> = merged bag after <code>inserting</code></td></tr><tr><td>update</td><td><code>instance[updateMethod](values, keys, oldValues)</code> where <code>values</code> = merged bag after <code>updating</code></td></tr><tr><td>delete</td><td><code>instance[deleteMethod](keys, oldValues)</code>; <code>keys</code> is <code>deletingArgs.keys</code> (the same object the caller passed, mutable from <code>deleting</code>)</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p><code>await</code> is applied to the return value, so methods may be sync or async. For insert/update/delete: <code>affectedRows = typeof returnValue === &quot;number&quot; ? returnValue : 1</code>.</p>\n<p><strong>Paging and sorting in select:</strong> the bag is <code>selectParameters</code> evaluated, then, <strong>only when <code>enablePaging</code> is true</strong>, <code>bag[startRowIndexParameterName] = selectArgs.startRowIndex</code> and <code>bag[maximumRowsParameterName] = selectArgs.maximumRows</code> (each only when defined). Then, <strong>regardless of <code>enablePaging</code></strong>, if <code>selectArgs.sortExpression</code> is truthy and <code>sortParameterName</code> is truthy, <code>bag[sortParameterName] = sortExpression</code>. Unlike <code>SqlDataSource</code>, these assignments <strong>overwrite</strong> a same-named declared parameter. The second argument (<code>selectArgs</code>) always carries the raw paging values, even with <code>enablePaging: false</code> (verified).</p>\n<p><code>totalRowCount</code> for <code>selected</code> is computed as in <code>SqlDataSource</code> (<code>data.length</code> or <code>Number(data.total)</code>).</p>\n","events":"<h3 id=\"65-events\">6.5 Events<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#65-events\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<p>Same names and cancel semantics as section 3. <code>inserted</code> / <code>updated</code> / <code>deleted</code> fire even when the call failed (including &quot;method not found&quot;).</p>\n<hr>\n"},"accessdatasource":{"overview":"<p>Source: <code>access-data-source.ts</code>. Extends <code>DataSourceControl</code>.</p>\n<p><strong>ASP.NET equivalent:</strong> <code>AccessDataSource</code>. There is no <code>.mdb</code> access: it wraps an in-memory <code>DataTable</code> from <code>@wf-controls/data</code>.</p>\n","constructor-new-accessdatasource-options-accessdatasourceoptions":"<h3 id=\"71-constructor-new-accessdatasourceoptions-accessdatasourceoptions\">7.1 Constructor: <code>new AccessDataSource(options: AccessDataSourceOptions)</code><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#71-constructor-new-accessdatasourceoptions-accessdatasourceoptions\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Option</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>id</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>(required)</td><td>Also the name of the auto-created table</td></tr><tr><td><code>dataFilePath</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td><code>undefined</code></td><td>Stored only; never used</td></tr><tr><td><code>table</code></td><td><code>DataTable | undefined</code></td><td><code>undefined</code></td><td>Use this existing table. When given, <code>initialData</code> is <strong>ignored</strong></td></tr><tr><td><code>initialData</code></td><td><code>Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;[] | undefined</code></td><td><code>undefined</code></td><td>Seeds a new <code>DataTable(id)</code>. Columns are inferred from the <strong>first row only</strong>: <code>number</code> -&gt; <code>&quot;number&quot;</code>, <code>boolean</code> -&gt; <code>&quot;boolean&quot;</code>, everything else (strings, <code>Date</code>, <code>null</code>) -&gt; <code>&quot;string&quot;</code>. Rows are added then <code>acceptChanges()</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>filterExpression</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td><code>undefined</code></td><td>Passed to <code>DataTable.select</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>sortExpression</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td><code>undefined</code></td><td>Default sort</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n","properties":"<h3 id=\"72-properties\">7.2 Properties<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#72-properties\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>R/W</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>dataFilePath</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td>rw</td><td></td><td>Unused</td></tr><tr><td><code>table</code></td><td><code>DataTable</code></td><td>rw</td><td>the given or created table</td><td>Direct access for schema/rows</td></tr><tr><td><code>filterExpression</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td>rw</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>sortExpression</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td>rw</td><td></td><td>Overridden per call by <code>selectArgs.sortExpression</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>It has no parameter collections and does not use <code>parameterContext</code>.</p>\n","methods":"<h3 id=\"73-methods\">7.3 Methods<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#73-methods\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Signature</th><th>Returns</th><th>Throws</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>select(selectArgs = {})</code></td><td><code>Promise&lt;unknown[]&gt;</code> (array of plain objects via <code>row.toObject()</code>)</td><td>Filter syntax errors from <code>DataTable.select</code> (e.g. <code>Unsupported filter expression syntax: ...</code>)</td><td>Sort = <code>selectArgs.sortExpression ?? this.sortExpression</code>. Filters, sorts, then slices if <code>startRowIndex</code> or <code>maximumRows</code> is defined. <code>selected.totalRowCount</code> is the count <strong>before</strong> slicing</td></tr><tr><td><code>insert(values)</code></td><td><code>Promise&lt;1&gt;</code></td><td>row/DataTable errors</td><td><code>table.rows.add(values)</code> then <code>table.acceptChanges()</code>. Always returns <code>1</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>update(keys, values, oldValues?)</code></td><td><code>Promise&lt;number&gt;</code></td><td></td><td>For every row where every <code>keys</code> entry equals the row value with <code>===</code>: <code>beginEdit</code>, <code>setItem</code> for each <code>values</code> entry, <code>endEdit</code>. <code>acceptChanges()</code> if any matched. Returns the match count (<code>0</code> is not an error). <code>oldValues</code> is only passed to the event</td></tr><tr><td><code>delete(keys, oldValues?)</code></td><td><code>Promise&lt;number&gt;</code></td><td></td><td>Same matching; <code>row.delete()</code> on each; <code>acceptChanges()</code>; returns count</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p><strong>Filter syntax (implemented by <code>DataTable.select</code>):</strong> conditions <code>field op value</code>, <code>op</code> in <code>= &lt;&gt; != &lt; &lt;= &gt; &gt;= LIKE</code> (<code>%</code> and <code>_</code> wildcards, case-insensitive), joined by <code>AND</code> / <code>OR</code> (split on <code>OR</code> first, then <code>AND</code>; no parentheses). Values: quoted strings, numbers, <code>true</code>, <code>false</code>, <code>null</code>. Comparison uses strict equality for <code>=</code>. Sort: comma list of <code>column [ASC|DESC]</code>.</p>\n","events":"<h3 id=\"74-events\">7.4 Events<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#74-events\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Event</th><th>Args</th><th>Cancellable</th><th>Raised</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>selecting</code></td><td><code>DataSourceSelectingEventArgs</code> (<code>parameters</code> is always <code>{}</code>)</td><td>Yes (<code>[]</code>)</td><td>Before select</td></tr><tr><td><code>selected</code></td><td><code>{ data: items, totalRowCount }</code></td><td>No</td><td>After slice</td></tr><tr><td><code>inserting</code></td><td><code>values</code> is the caller's own object (same reference)</td><td>Yes (<code>0</code>)</td><td>Before insert</td></tr><tr><td><code>inserted</code></td><td><code>{ affectedRows: 1, returnValue: values, exceptionHandled: false }</code></td><td>No</td><td>After insert; no <code>exception</code> is ever set (failures throw directly)</td></tr><tr><td><code>updating</code></td><td><code>keys</code>, <code>values</code>, <code>oldValues</code></td><td>Yes (<code>0</code>)</td><td>Before update</td></tr><tr><td><code>updated</code></td><td><code>{ affectedRows, exceptionHandled: false }</code></td><td>No</td><td>After update</td></tr><tr><td><code>deleting</code></td><td><code>keys</code>, <code>oldValues</code></td><td>Yes (<code>0</code>)</td><td>Before delete</td></tr><tr><td><code>deleted</code></td><td><code>{ affectedRows, exceptionHandled: false }</code></td><td>No</td><td>After delete</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>Because <code>-ing</code> handlers receive the caller's objects, mutating <code>e.values</code> in <code>inserting</code> does change what is inserted (insert case only). For <code>updating</code>, <code>e.values</code> and <code>e.keys</code> are the caller's objects, so mutations also take effect (matching runs after the event).</p>\n","gotchas":"<h3 id=\"75-gotchas\">7.5 Gotchas<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#75-gotchas\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<ul><li>Every write calls <code>table.acceptChanges()</code>, so <code>DataTable</code> change tracking (<code>rowState</code>, <code>getChanges</code>) is reset after each call; deleted rows are physically removed.</li><li><code>delete({})</code> / <code>update({}, v)</code> match <strong>all</strong> rows (verified: <code>delete({}) -&gt; 2</code>, table emptied).</li><li>Unknown columns in <code>values</code> are silently ignored by the row. On a table without columns, <code>insert</code> adds an empty row.</li><li><code>Date</code> values in <code>initialData</code> become strings on a string-typed column.</li><li>Equality is <code>===</code>: key <code>{ id: &quot;1&quot; }</code> does not match numeric <code>1</code>.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n"},"xmldatasource":{"overview":"<p>Source: <code>xml-data-source.ts</code>. Extends <code>DataSourceControl</code>. <strong>Read-only.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>ASP.NET equivalent:</strong> <code>XmlDataSource</code> (<code>Data</code>, <code>DataFile</code>, <code>XPath</code>), with a drastically reduced XPath engine.</p>\n","constructor-new-xmldatasource-options-xmldatasourceoptions":"<h3 id=\"81-constructor-new-xmldatasourceoptions-xmldatasourceoptions\">8.1 Constructor: <code>new XmlDataSource(options: XmlDataSourceOptions)</code><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#81-constructor-new-xmldatasourceoptions-xmldatasourceoptions\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Option</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>id</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>(required)</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>data</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td><code>undefined</code></td><td>Inline XML text; takes precedence over <code>dataFile</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>dataFile</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td><code>undefined</code></td><td>URL fetched with global <code>fetch</code> and read as text (only when <code>data</code> is falsy and <code>fetch</code> exists). HTTP status is <strong>not</strong> checked</td></tr><tr><td><code>xPath</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td><code>undefined</code></td><td>See &quot;XPath support&quot;</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n","properties":"<h3 id=\"82-properties\">8.2 Properties<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#82-properties\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<p><code>data</code>, <code>dataFile</code>, <code>xPath</code>: all <code>string | undefined</code>, read/write, defaults from options. No parameter collections; <code>parameterContext</code> is unused.</p>\n","methods":"<h3 id=\"83-methods\">8.3 Methods<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#83-methods\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Signature</th><th>Returns</th><th>Throws</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>select(selectArgs = {})</code></td><td><code>Promise&lt;Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;[]&gt;</code></td><td><code>fetch</code> rejections for <code>dataFile</code></td><td>Emits <code>selecting</code> (cancel returns <code>[]</code>); loads text; no text returns <code>[]</code> <strong>without</strong> raising <code>selected</code>; parses; slices by <code>startRowIndex</code> / <code>maximumRows</code>; emits <code>selected</code> with <code>totalRowCount</code> before slicing</td></tr><tr><td><code>insert()</code></td><td><code>Promise&lt;number&gt;</code></td><td>always: <code>&quot;XmlDataSource does not support insert operations directly.&quot;</code></td><td>Rejects; no events</td></tr><tr><td><code>update()</code></td><td><code>Promise&lt;number&gt;</code></td><td><code>&quot;XmlDataSource does not support update operations directly.&quot;</code></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>delete()</code></td><td><code>Promise&lt;number&gt;</code></td><td><code>&quot;XmlDataSource does not support delete operations directly.&quot;</code></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p><code>sortExpression</code> is ignored. Events: only <code>selecting</code> (cancellable) and <code>selected</code> are ever raised; the other six never fire.</p>\n","xpath-support-exactly-as-implemented":"<h3 id=\"84-xpath-support-exactly-as-implemented\">8.4 XPath support, exactly as implemented<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#84-xpath-support-exactly-as-implemented\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<p>Both parsers reduce <code>xPath</code> to <strong>one element name</strong>: <code>xPath.replace(/^\\/+/, &quot;&quot;).split(&quot;/&quot;)[0]</code>, i.e. strip all leading slashes and take the first path segment.</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th><code>xPath</code></th><th>Effective element name</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>&quot;book&quot;</code>, <code>&quot;/book&quot;</code>, <code>&quot;//book&quot;</code></td><td><code>book</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>&quot;/catalog/book&quot;</code></td><td><code>catalog</code> (<strong>not</strong> <code>book</code>)</td></tr><tr><td><code>&quot;/catalog/book[@lang='en']&quot;</code></td><td><code>catalog</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>&quot;book[@id='1']&quot;</code></td><td><code>book[@id='1']</code>: literally, matches nothing useful</td></tr><tr><td><code>undefined</code> / <code>&quot;&quot;</code></td><td>none</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>Not supported: child paths, predicates, attribute selection (<code>@id</code>), functions, axes, wildcards, namespaces. To select nested elements use just the element name (<code>&quot;book&quot;</code>), which matches that element at any depth.</p>\n<p><strong>Parser selection:</strong> if <code>DOMParser</code> is defined (browsers) it is used; otherwise (Node, workers) a regex fallback is used. They differ:</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th></th><th>DOM path (browser; from source, not run here)</th><th>Fallback path (Node; verified)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Match</td><td><code>doc.getElementsByTagName(name)</code>, all descendants with that name</td><td>Regex <code>&lt;name ...&gt;...&lt;/name&gt;</code> or <code>&lt;name .../&gt;</code>, case-insensitive</td></tr><tr><td>No <code>xPath</code></td><td>children of the root element</td><td><strong>Returns <code>[]</code> for ordinary documents</strong> (see bug below)</td></tr><tr><td>Attributes</td><td>all attributes as string fields</td><td>attributes via <code>key=&quot;v&quot;</code> / <code>key='v'</code></td></tr><tr><td>Child elements</td><td>each direct child: <code>record[child.tagName] = textContent.trim()</code></td><td>children matching <code>&lt;c ...&gt;text-without-tags&lt;/c&gt;</code> only; duplicates: <strong>last wins</strong>; nested elements are not read</td></tr><tr><td>Text-only element (no attrs or children)</td><td><code>{ value: text }</code></td><td>dropped (record empty, not added)</td></tr><tr><td>Element with no attributes, children or text</td><td><code>{}</code> (a record is still returned)</td><td>skipped (empty record is not added)</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>Fallback problems (all verified):</p>\n<ul><li><code>&lt;i k=&quot;1&quot;/&gt;&lt;i k=&quot;2&quot;&gt;z&lt;/i&gt;</code> returns only <code>[{ k: &quot;1&quot; }]</code>: the self-closing tag's lazy match swallows the next sibling up to the next <code>&lt;/i&gt;</code>.</li><li><code>&lt;i&gt;text&lt;/i&gt;</code> yields no record.</li><li><code>xPath: &quot;/catalog/book&quot;</code> yields a single record for <code>catalog</code> containing only the last nested <code>title</code>/<code>price</code>.</li><li>With no <code>xPath</code> the generic regex reads the tag name as the attribute group and returns no useful records.</li></ul>\n<p>For predictable cross-environment results use a simple element name (<code>xPath: &quot;book&quot;</code>), attribute/flat-child XML, and avoid self-closing siblings next to full elements when running outside a browser.</p>\n","events":"<h3 id=\"85-events\">8.5 Events<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#85-events\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Event</th><th>Args</th><th>Cancellable</th><th>Raised</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>selecting</code></td><td><code>DataSourceSelectingEventArgs</code> (<code>parameters: {}</code>)</td><td>Yes</td><td>Before loading</td></tr><tr><td><code>selected</code></td><td><code>{ data, totalRowCount }</code></td><td>No</td><td>After parse and slice; skipped when there is no XML text</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<hr>\n"},"sitemapdatasource":{"overview":"<p>Source: <code>sitemap-data-source.ts</code>. Extends <code>DataSourceControl</code>. <strong>Read-only.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>ASP.NET equivalent:</strong> <code>SiteMapDataSource</code> (with <code>ShowStartingNode</code>, <code>StartingNodeUrl</code>), plus the <code>SiteMap.CurrentNode</code> / <code>SiteMapPath</code> lookups folded into <code>findNode</code> / <code>getBreadcrumbs</code>.</p>\n","sitemapnode":"<h3 id=\"91-sitemapnode\">9.1 <code>SiteMapNode</code><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#91-sitemapnode\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>key</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td>Optional unique key</td></tr><tr><td><code>url</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td>Optional URL</td></tr><tr><td><code>title</code></td><td><code>string</code> (required)</td><td>Display text</td></tr><tr><td><code>description</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td>Tooltip text</td></tr><tr><td><code>roles</code></td><td><code>string[] | undefined</code></td><td><strong>Stored only. No security trimming is performed</strong> (verified: Admin-only node is still returned)</td></tr><tr><td><code>childNodes</code></td><td><code>SiteMapNode[] | undefined</code></td><td>Child nodes</td></tr><tr><td><code>parent</code></td><td><code>SiteMapNode | undefined</code></td><td>Set automatically by the data source</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n","constructor-new-sitemapdatasource-options-sitemapdatasourceoptions":"<h3 id=\"92-constructor-new-sitemapdatasourceoptions-sitemapdatasourceoptions\">9.2 Constructor: <code>new SiteMapDataSource(options: SiteMapDataSourceOptions)</code><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#92-constructor-new-sitemapdatasourceoptions-sitemapdatasourceoptions\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Option</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>id</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>(required)</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>siteMap</code></td><td><code>SiteMapNode | undefined</code></td><td><code>undefined</code></td><td>Root node. If given, <code>parent</code> is assigned on <strong>every node, mutating your objects</strong> (root <code>parent</code> = <code>undefined</code>)</td></tr><tr><td><code>showStartingNode</code></td><td><code>boolean | undefined</code></td><td><code>true</code></td><td>Return the starting node itself vs only its children</td></tr><tr><td><code>startingNodeUrl</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td><code>undefined</code></td><td>Key or URL of the node to start from</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n","properties":"<h3 id=\"93-properties\">9.3 Properties<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#93-properties\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>R/W</th><th>Default</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>siteMap</code></td><td><code>SiteMapNode | undefined</code></td><td>rw</td><td>from options</td></tr><tr><td><code>showStartingNode</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td>rw</td><td><code>true</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>startingNodeUrl</code></td><td><code>string | undefined</code></td><td>rw</td><td>from options</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>Gotcha: parent links are only built in the constructor. If you assign <code>ds.siteMap = newTree</code> later, <code>parent</code> is not set, so <code>getBreadcrumbs</code> returns only the found node. Build the tree before constructing, or set parents yourself.</p>\n","methods":"<h3 id=\"94-methods\">9.4 Methods<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#94-methods\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Signature</th><th>Returns</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>findNode(urlOrKey: string, node: SiteMapNode | undefined = this.siteMap): SiteMapNode | undefined</code></td><td>node or <code>undefined</code></td><td>Depth-first, pre-order search for <code>node.key === v || node.url === v</code>. Exact string comparison (no URL normalisation, case-sensitive)</td></tr><tr><td><code>getBreadcrumbs(currentUrlOrKey: string): SiteMapNode[]</code></td><td>root-to-node array; <code>[]</code> if not found</td><td>Walks <code>parent</code> from <code>findNode</code> result</td></tr><tr><td><code>select(selectArgs = {})</code></td><td><code>Promise&lt;SiteMapNode[]&gt;</code></td><td>Emits <code>selecting</code> (cancel or no <code>siteMap</code> returns <code>[]</code>, no <code>selected</code>). Starting node = <code>findNode(startingNodeUrl)</code> if set and found, else the root (an unknown <code>startingNodeUrl</code> silently falls back to the root). Result is <code>[startingNode]</code> if <code>showStartingNode</code>, else <code>startingNode.childNodes ?? []</code>. Emits <code>selected</code> with <code>totalRowCount = result.length</code>. <code>selectArgs</code> are ignored</td></tr><tr><td><code>insert()</code> / <code>update()</code> / <code>delete()</code></td><td><code>Promise&lt;number&gt;</code></td><td>Always throw <code>&quot;SiteMapDataSource does not support insert|update|delete operations.&quot;</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p><strong>Hierarchy:</strong> the returned data is the live <code>SiteMapNode</code> tree (not copies); hierarchical consumers recurse via <code>childNodes</code>. Because of <code>parent</code>, the result is <strong>circular and <code>JSON.stringify</code> throws <code>TypeError</code></strong> (verified); map to a plain shape first (see example 6).</p>\n","events":"<h3 id=\"95-events\">9.5 Events<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#95-events\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Event</th><th>Args</th><th>Cancellable</th><th>Raised</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>selecting</code></td><td><code>DataSourceSelectingEventArgs</code> (<code>parameters: {}</code>)</td><td>Yes</td><td>Before building the result</td></tr><tr><td><code>selected</code></td><td><code>{ data: SiteMapNode[], totalRowCount }</code></td><td>No</td><td>After</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<hr>\n"},"examples":{"examples":"<p>Every example below was run against the built package; the <code>// -&gt;</code> lines are the real output. (Imports use the package name; the verification scripts imported from <code>packages/core/dist/index.js</code>.)</p>\n<ul class=\"aa-doc-index\"><li><a href=\"#/api/data-sources/examples/examples/example-1-rest-backed-sqldatasource-with-a-mock-fetch\">Example 1: REST-backed SqlDataSource with a mock fetch</a></li><li><a href=\"#/api/data-sources/examples/examples/example-2-sqldatasource-with-a-custom-handler-adapter-doing-paging-sorting-and-totals\">Example 2: SqlDataSource with a custom handler (adapter) doing paging, sorting and totals</a></li><li><a href=\"#/api/data-sources/examples/examples/example-3-objectdatasource-with-a-service-class-and-a-controlparameter\">Example 3: ObjectDataSource with a service class and a ControlParameter</a></li><li><a href=\"#/api/data-sources/examples/examples/example-4-accessdatasource-crud-against-a-datatable\">Example 4: AccessDataSource CRUD against a DataTable</a></li><li><a href=\"#/api/data-sources/examples/examples/example-5-xmldatasource-with-a-simple-element-xpath\">Example 5: XmlDataSource with a simple element XPath</a></li><li><a href=\"#/api/data-sources/examples/examples/example-6-sitemapdatasource-feeding-a-menu-and-breadcrumbs\">Example 6: SiteMapDataSource feeding a menu and breadcrumbs</a></li><li><a href=\"#/api/data-sources/examples/examples/example-7-parameter-binding-from-controls-query-string-session-and-form\">Example 7: Parameter binding from controls, query string, session and form</a></li><li><a href=\"#/api/data-sources/examples/examples/example-8-events---parameter-injection-cancel-error-handling\">Example 8: Events - parameter injection, cancel, error handling</a></li><li><a href=\"#/api/data-sources/examples/examples/example-9-custom-parameter-precedence-and-defaults-declared-vs-injected-paging\">Example 9: Custom Parameter precedence and defaults (declared vs injected paging)</a></li></ul><h3 id=\"example-1-rest-backed-sqldatasource-with-a-mock-fetch\">Example 1: REST-backed SqlDataSource with a mock <code>fetch</code><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#example-1-rest-backed-sqldatasource-with-a-mock-fetch\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span class=\"code-lang\">ts</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\">Copy</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-ts\"><span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> { <span class=\"tok-t\">SqlDataSource</span>, <span class=\"tok-t\">Parameter</span> } <span class=\"tok-k\">from</span> <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;@wf-controls/core&quot;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> db = [{ id: <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>, name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Hammer&quot;</span>, category: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Hardware&quot;</span> }, { id: <span class=\"tok-n\">2</span>, name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Saw&quot;</span>, category: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Hardware&quot;</span> }];\nglobalThis.fetch = <span class=\"tok-k\">async</span> (url, init) =&gt; {\n  console.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(init.method, url, init.body ?? <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;&quot;</span>);\n  <span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> u = <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">URL</span>(url);\n  <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> (init.method === <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;GET&quot;</span>) {\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> cat = u.searchParams.<span class=\"tok-k\">get</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;category&quot;</span>);\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">Response</span>(<span class=\"tok-t\">JSON</span>.<span class=\"tok-f\">stringify</span>(db.<span class=\"tok-f\">filter</span>(r =&gt; !cat || r.category === cat)), { status: <span class=\"tok-n\">200</span> });\n  }\n  <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> (init.method === <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;POST&quot;</span>) { <span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> b = <span class=\"tok-t\">JSON</span>.<span class=\"tok-f\">parse</span>(init.body); db.<span class=\"tok-f\">push</span>({ id: <span class=\"tok-n\">3</span>, ...b }); <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">Response</span>(<span class=\"tok-t\">JSON</span>.<span class=\"tok-f\">stringify</span>({ id: <span class=\"tok-n\">3</span> }), { status: <span class=\"tok-n\">201</span> }); }\n  <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> (init.method === <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;PUT&quot;</span>) <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">Response</span>(<span class=\"tok-k\">null</span>, { status: <span class=\"tok-n\">204</span> });\n  <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> (init.method === <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;DELETE&quot;</span>) <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">Response</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;&quot;</span>, { status: <span class=\"tok-n\">200</span> });\n  <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">Response</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;nope&quot;</span>, { status: <span class=\"tok-n\">500</span>, statusText: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Server Error&quot;</span> });\n};\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> ds = <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">SqlDataSource</span>({\n  id: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Rest&quot;</span>,\n  connectionString: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;https://api.example.com/&quot;</span>,\n  selectCommand: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;GET /api/products&quot;</span>,\n  insertCommand: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;/api/products&quot;</span>,                 <span class=\"tok-c\">// no verb: operation decides (POST)</span>\n  updateCommand: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;PUT /api/products/{id}&quot;</span>,\n  deleteCommand: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;DELETE /api/products/{id}&quot;</span>,\n  selectParameters: [<span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">Parameter</span>({ name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;category&quot;</span>, defaultValue: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Hardware&quot;</span> })]\n});\n\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>((<span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">select</span>()).length, <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;rows&quot;</span>);\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;insert -&gt;&quot;</span>, <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">insert</span>({ name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Drill&quot;</span>, category: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Power&quot;</span> }));\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;update -&gt;&quot;</span>, <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">update</span>({ id: <span class=\"tok-n\">3</span> }, { name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Drill XL&quot;</span> }));\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;delete -&gt;&quot;</span>, <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-k\">delete</span>({ id: <span class=\"tok-n\">3</span> }));\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// Failure + exceptionHandled</span>\nds.deleteCommand = <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;DELETE /api/missing/{id}&quot;</span>;\nglobalThis.fetch = <span class=\"tok-k\">async</span> () =&gt; <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">Response</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;&quot;</span>, { status: <span class=\"tok-n\">404</span>, statusText: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Not Found&quot;</span> });\nds.deleted.<span class=\"tok-f\">subscribe</span>((_s, e) =&gt; { console.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;deleted exception:&quot;</span>, e.exception?.message, <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;affected:&quot;</span>, e.affectedRows); e.exceptionHandled = <span class=\"tok-k\">true</span>; });\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;delete (handled) -&gt;&quot;</span>, <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-k\">delete</span>({ id: <span class=\"tok-n\">9</span> }));\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; GET https://api.example.com/api/products?category=Hardware</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; 2 rows</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; POST https://api.example.com/api/products {&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Drill&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;Power&quot;}</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; insert -&gt; 1</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; PUT https://api.example.com/api/products/3 {&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Drill XL&quot;}</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; update -&gt; 1</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; DELETE https://api.example.com/api/products/3 {}</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; delete -&gt; 1</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; deleted exception: HTTP error 404: Not Found affected: 0</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; delete (handled) -&gt; 0</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>Note how <code>{id}</code> is consumed by the URL and omitted from the JSON body, <code>category</code> became a query string, and the insert's <code>{ id: 3 }</code> response is not a number so <code>affectedRows</code> is <code>1</code>.</p>\n<h3 id=\"example-2-sqldatasource-with-a-custom-handler-adapter-doing-paging-sorting-and-totals\">Example 2: SqlDataSource with a custom handler (adapter) doing paging, sorting and totals<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#example-2-sqldatasource-with-a-custom-handler-adapter-doing-paging-sorting-and-totals\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span class=\"code-lang\">ts</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\">Copy</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-ts\"><span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> { <span class=\"tok-t\">SqlDataSource</span>, <span class=\"tok-t\">Parameter</span> } <span class=\"tok-k\">from</span> <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;@wf-controls/core&quot;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> table = [\n  { id: <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>, name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Ada&quot;</span>, city: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;London&quot;</span> }, { id: <span class=\"tok-n\">2</span>, name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Bob&quot;</span>, city: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Paris&quot;</span> },\n  { id: <span class=\"tok-n\">3</span>, name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Cy&quot;</span>, city: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;London&quot;</span> }, { id: <span class=\"tok-n\">4</span>, name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Di&quot;</span>, city: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Rome&quot;</span> }\n];\n<span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> handler = <span class=\"tok-k\">async</span> (command, p, operation, selectArgs) =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"tok-k\">switch</span> (operation) {\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">case</span> <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;select&quot;</span>: {\n      <span class=\"tok-k\">let</span> rows = table.<span class=\"tok-f\">filter</span>(r =&gt; !p.city || r.city === p.city);\n      <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> (p.sortExpression) { <span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> [f, d = <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;ASC&quot;</span>] = p.sortExpression.<span class=\"tok-f\">split</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot; &quot;</span>); rows = [...rows].<span class=\"tok-f\">sort</span>((a, b) =&gt; (a[f] &gt; b[f] ? <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span> : -<span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>) * (d === <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;DESC&quot;</span> ? -<span class=\"tok-n\">1</span> : <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>)); }\n      <span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> total = rows.length;\n      <span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> start = selectArgs?.startRowIndex ?? <span class=\"tok-n\">0</span>;\n      <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> { total, rows: rows.<span class=\"tok-f\">slice</span>(start, start + (selectArgs?.maximumRows ?? total)) };\n    }\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">case</span> <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;insert&quot;</span>: table.<span class=\"tok-f\">push</span>({ id: table.length + <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>, ...p }); <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">case</span> <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;update&quot;</span>: { <span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> r = table.<span class=\"tok-f\">find</span>(x =&gt; x.id === p.id); <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> (!r) <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">0</span>; <span class=\"tok-t\">Object</span>.<span class=\"tok-f\">assign</span>(r, p); <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>; }\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">case</span> <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;delete&quot;</span>: { <span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> i = table.<span class=\"tok-f\">findIndex</span>(x =&gt; x.id === p.id); <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> (i &lt; <span class=\"tok-n\">0</span>) <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">0</span>; table.<span class=\"tok-f\">splice</span>(i, <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>); <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>; }\n  }\n};\n<span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> ds = <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">SqlDataSource</span>({\n  id: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;People&quot;</span>, selectCommand: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;people.list&quot;</span>, insertCommand: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;people.add&quot;</span>, updateCommand: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;people.save&quot;</span>, deleteCommand: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;people.remove&quot;</span>,\n  selectParameters: [<span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">Parameter</span>({ name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;city&quot;</span>, defaultValue: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;London&quot;</span> })], handler\n});\nds.selected.<span class=\"tok-f\">subscribe</span>((_s, e) =&gt; console.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;totalRowCount:&quot;</span>, e.totalRowCount));\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">select</span>({ startRowIndex: <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>, maximumRows: <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>, sortExpression: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;name DESC&quot;</span> }));\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">update</span>({ id: <span class=\"tok-n\">2</span> }, { name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Bobby&quot;</span> }), <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">update</span>({ id: <span class=\"tok-n\">99</span> }, { name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;?&quot;</span> }));\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-k\">delete</span>({ id: <span class=\"tok-n\">4</span> }), table.length);\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; totalRowCount: 2</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; { total: 2, rows: [ { id: 1, name: 'Ada', city: 'London' } ] }</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; 1 0</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; 1 3</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>The returned object is passed through as-is (<code>{ total, rows }</code>); only <code>total</code> is picked up for <code>totalRowCount</code>. A handler that returns a number controls <code>affectedRows</code> (<code>update</code> of id 99 gave <code>0</code>).</p>\n<h3 id=\"example-3-objectdatasource-with-a-service-class-and-a-controlparameter\">Example 3: ObjectDataSource with a service class and a ControlParameter<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#example-3-objectdatasource-with-a-service-class-and-a-controlparameter\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span class=\"code-lang\">ts</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\">Copy</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-ts\"><span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> { <span class=\"tok-t\">ObjectDataSource</span>, <span class=\"tok-t\">ControlParameter</span> } <span class=\"tok-k\">from</span> <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;@wf-controls/core&quot;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">class</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">ProductService</span> {\n  <span class=\"tok-f\">constructor</span>() { <span class=\"tok-k\">this</span>.items = [{ id: <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>, name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Hammer&quot;</span>, cat: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Hardware&quot;</span> }, { id: <span class=\"tok-n\">2</span>, name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Saw&quot;</span>, cat: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Hardware&quot;</span> }, { id: <span class=\"tok-n\">3</span>, name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Rose&quot;</span>, cat: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Garden&quot;</span> }]; }\n  <span class=\"tok-f\">getProducts</span>(params, selectArgs) {\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">let</span> r = <span class=\"tok-k\">this</span>.items.<span class=\"tok-f\">filter</span>(p =&gt; !params.cat || p.cat === params.cat);\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> (params.sortExpression) { <span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> [f, d] = params.sortExpression.<span class=\"tok-f\">split</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot; &quot;</span>); r = [...r].<span class=\"tok-f\">sort</span>((a, b) =&gt; <span class=\"tok-t\">String</span>(a[f]).<span class=\"tok-f\">localeCompare</span>(<span class=\"tok-t\">String</span>(b[f])) * (d === <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;DESC&quot;</span> ? -<span class=\"tok-n\">1</span> : <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>)); }\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> total = r.length;\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> start = params.startRowIndex ?? <span class=\"tok-n\">0</span>, max = params.maximumRows ?? total;\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> { rows: r.<span class=\"tok-f\">slice</span>(start, start + max), total };\n  }\n  <span class=\"tok-f\">addProduct</span>(values) { <span class=\"tok-k\">this</span>.items.<span class=\"tok-f\">push</span>({ id: <span class=\"tok-k\">this</span>.items.length + <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>, ...values }); <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>; }\n  <span class=\"tok-f\">saveProduct</span>(values, keys, oldValues) { <span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> p = <span class=\"tok-k\">this</span>.items.<span class=\"tok-f\">find</span>(i =&gt; i.id === keys.id); <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> (!p) <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">0</span>; <span class=\"tok-t\">Object</span>.<span class=\"tok-f\">assign</span>(p, values); <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>; }\n  <span class=\"tok-f\">removeProduct</span>(keys) { <span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> n = <span class=\"tok-k\">this</span>.items.length; <span class=\"tok-k\">this</span>.items = <span class=\"tok-k\">this</span>.items.<span class=\"tok-f\">filter</span>(i =&gt; i.id !== keys.id); <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> n - <span class=\"tok-k\">this</span>.items.length; }\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> svc = <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">ProductService</span>();\n<span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> ds = <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">ObjectDataSource</span>({\n  id: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Obj&quot;</span>,\n  typeInstance: () =&gt; svc,             <span class=\"tok-c\">// factory: invoked on every operation</span>\n  selectMethod: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;getProducts&quot;</span>, insertMethod: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;addProduct&quot;</span>, updateMethod: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;saveProduct&quot;</span>, deleteMethod: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;removeProduct&quot;</span>,\n  enablePaging: <span class=\"tok-k\">true</span>,\n  selectParameters: [<span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">ControlParameter</span>({ name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;cat&quot;</span>, controlId: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;ddlCategory&quot;</span>, propertyName: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;value&quot;</span> })]\n});\nds.parameterContext = { controls: { ddlCategory: { value: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Hardware&quot;</span> } } };\n\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">select</span>({ startRowIndex: <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>, maximumRows: <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>, sortExpression: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;name ASC&quot;</span> }));\nds.selected.<span class=\"tok-f\">subscribe</span>((_s, e) =&gt; console.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;selected total:&quot;</span>, e.totalRowCount));\n<span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">select</span>();\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;insert&quot;</span>, <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">insert</span>({ name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Drill&quot;</span>, cat: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Hardware&quot;</span> }));\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;update&quot;</span>, <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">update</span>({ id: <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span> }, { name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Claw Hammer&quot;</span> }));\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;delete&quot;</span>, <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-k\">delete</span>({ id: <span class=\"tok-n\">2</span> }));\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(svc.items.<span class=\"tok-f\">map</span>(i =&gt; i.name));\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; { rows: [ { id: 2, name: 'Saw', cat: 'Hardware' } ], total: 2 }</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; selected total: 2</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; insert 1</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; update 1</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; delete 1</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; [ 'Claw Hammer', 'Rose', 'Drill' ]</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"example-4-accessdatasource-crud-against-a-datatable\">Example 4: AccessDataSource CRUD against a DataTable<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#example-4-accessdatasource-crud-against-a-datatable\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span class=\"code-lang\">ts</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\">Copy</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-ts\"><span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> { <span class=\"tok-t\">AccessDataSource</span> } <span class=\"tok-k\">from</span> <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;@wf-controls/core&quot;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> ds = <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">AccessDataSource</span>({\n  id: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Employees&quot;</span>,\n  initialData: [\n    { id: <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>, name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Ada&quot;</span>, dept: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Eng&quot;</span>, salary: <span class=\"tok-n\">120</span> },\n    { id: <span class=\"tok-n\">2</span>, name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Bob&quot;</span>, dept: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Ops&quot;</span>, salary: <span class=\"tok-n\">80</span> },\n    { id: <span class=\"tok-n\">3</span>, name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Cy&quot;</span>, dept: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Eng&quot;</span>, salary: <span class=\"tok-n\">100</span> }\n  ],\n  filterExpression: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;dept = 'Eng'&quot;</span>,\n  sortExpression: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;salary DESC&quot;</span>\n});\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;columns:&quot;</span>, ds.table.columns.<span class=\"tok-f\">toArray</span>().<span class=\"tok-f\">map</span>(c =&gt; c.columnName + <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;:&quot;</span> + c.dataType));\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">select</span>());\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;page:&quot;</span>, <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">select</span>({ startRowIndex: <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>, maximumRows: <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span> }));\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;insert&quot;</span>, <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">insert</span>({ id: <span class=\"tok-n\">4</span>, name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Di&quot;</span>, dept: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Eng&quot;</span>, salary: <span class=\"tok-n\">90</span> }));\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;update&quot;</span>, <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">update</span>({ id: <span class=\"tok-n\">2</span> }, { salary: <span class=\"tok-n\">85</span> }));\nds.filterExpression = <span class=\"tok-k\">undefined</span>;\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;all:&quot;</span>, (<span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">select</span>({ sortExpression: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;id&quot;</span> })).<span class=\"tok-f\">map</span>(r =&gt; r.name + <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;:&quot;</span> + r.salary));\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;delete&quot;</span>, <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-k\">delete</span>({ id: <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span> }));\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;rows left:&quot;</span>, ds.table.rows.count);\nds.deleting.<span class=\"tok-f\">subscribe</span>((_s, e) =&gt; { e.cancel = <span class=\"tok-k\">true</span>; });\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;cancelled delete&quot;</span>, <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-k\">delete</span>({ id: <span class=\"tok-n\">2</span> }));\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; columns: [ 'id:number', 'name:string', 'dept:string', 'salary:number' ]</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; [ { id: 1, name: 'Ada', dept: 'Eng', salary: 120 }, { id: 3, name: 'Cy', dept: 'Eng', salary: 100 } ]</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; page: [ { id: 3, name: 'Cy', dept: 'Eng', salary: 100 } ]</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; insert 1</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; update 1</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; all: [ 'Ada:120', 'Bob:85', 'Cy:100', 'Di:90' ]</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; delete 1</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; rows left: 3</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; cancelled delete 0</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>(The real output prints the two-row array across lines; shortened here.)</p>\n<h3 id=\"example-5-xmldatasource-with-a-simple-element-xpath\">Example 5: XmlDataSource with a simple element XPath<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#example-5-xmldatasource-with-a-simple-element-xpath\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span class=\"code-lang\">ts</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\">Copy</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-ts\"><span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> { <span class=\"tok-t\">XmlDataSource</span> } <span class=\"tok-k\">from</span> <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;@wf-controls/core&quot;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> xml = <span class=\"tok-s\">`&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot;?&gt;\n&lt;catalog&gt;\n  &lt;book id=&quot;b1&quot; lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Dune&lt;/title&gt;&lt;price&gt;9.99&lt;/price&gt;&lt;/book&gt;\n  &lt;book id=&quot;b2&quot; lang=&quot;fr&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Le Petit Prince&lt;/title&gt;&lt;price&gt;7.50&lt;/price&gt;&lt;/book&gt;\n  &lt;book id=&quot;b3&quot;/&gt;\n  &lt;magazine id=&quot;m1&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Wired&lt;/title&gt;&lt;/magazine&gt;\n&lt;/catalog&gt;`</span>;\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> ds = <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">XmlDataSource</span>({ id: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Books&quot;</span>, data: xml, xPath: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;book&quot;</span> });\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;count:&quot;</span>, (<span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">select</span>()).length);\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;paged:&quot;</span>, <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">select</span>({ startRowIndex: <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>, maximumRows: <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span> }));\nds.xPath = <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;//magazine&quot;</span>;\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">select</span>());\n<span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> (<span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> op <span class=\"tok-k\">of</span> [<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;insert&quot;</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;update&quot;</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;delete&quot;</span>]) {\n  <span class=\"tok-k\">try</span> { <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds[op](); } <span class=\"tok-k\">catch</span> (e) { console.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(op, <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;-&gt;&quot;</span>, e.message); }\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// Node (regex fallback, no DOMParser):</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; count: 3        (verified with the same document: `ds.xPath = &quot;book&quot;` returned 3 records)</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; paged: [ { id: 'b2', lang: 'fr', title: 'Le Petit Prince', price: '7.50' } ]</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; [ { id: 'm1', title: 'Wired' } ]</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; insert -&gt; XmlDataSource does not support insert operations directly.</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; update -&gt; XmlDataSource does not support update operations directly.</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; delete -&gt; XmlDataSource does not support delete operations directly.</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>Counter-example, also verified in Node: <code>xPath: &quot;/catalog/book&quot;</code> returned <code>[ { title: 'Wired', price: '7.50' } ]</code> (one <code>catalog</code> record), and <code>&quot;/catalog/book[@lang='en']&quot;</code> the same. Use <code>&quot;book&quot;</code>.</p>\n<h3 id=\"example-6-sitemapdatasource-feeding-a-menu-and-breadcrumbs\">Example 6: SiteMapDataSource feeding a menu and breadcrumbs<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#example-6-sitemapdatasource-feeding-a-menu-and-breadcrumbs\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span class=\"code-lang\">ts</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\">Copy</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-ts\"><span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> { <span class=\"tok-t\">SiteMapDataSource</span> } <span class=\"tok-k\">from</span> <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;@wf-controls/core&quot;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> ds = <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">SiteMapDataSource</span>({\n  id: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;SiteMap&quot;</span>,\n  siteMap: {\n    key: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;home&quot;</span>, url: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;/&quot;</span>, title: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Home&quot;</span>,\n    childNodes: [\n      { key: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;products&quot;</span>, url: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;/products&quot;</span>, title: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Products&quot;</span>, childNodes: [\n        { key: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;tools&quot;</span>, url: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;/products/tools&quot;</span>, title: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Tools&quot;</span> },\n        { url: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;/products/garden&quot;</span>, title: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Garden&quot;</span> }\n      ]},\n      { key: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;about&quot;</span>, url: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;/about&quot;</span>, title: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;About&quot;</span>, roles: [<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Admin&quot;</span>] }\n    ]\n  }\n});\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// Map to a plain (non-circular) shape for a menu control</span>\n<span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> toMenu = (n) =&gt; ({ label: n.title, href: n.url, children: (n.childNodes ?? []).<span class=\"tok-f\">map</span>(toMenu) });\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-t\">JSON</span>.<span class=\"tok-f\">stringify</span>((<span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">select</span>()).<span class=\"tok-f\">map</span>(toMenu)));\nds.showStartingNode = <span class=\"tok-k\">false</span>;                console.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>((<span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">select</span>()).<span class=\"tok-f\">map</span>(n =&gt; n.title));\nds.showStartingNode = <span class=\"tok-k\">true</span>; ds.startingNodeUrl = <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;/products&quot;</span>;  console.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>((<span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">select</span>()).<span class=\"tok-f\">map</span>(n =&gt; n.title));\nds.startingNodeUrl = <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;/nope&quot;</span>;               console.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;unknown start -&gt;&quot;</span>, (<span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">select</span>()).<span class=\"tok-f\">map</span>(n =&gt; n.title));\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">getBreadcrumbs</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;/products/tools&quot;</span>).<span class=\"tok-f\">map</span>(n =&gt; n.title).<span class=\"tok-f\">join</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot; &gt; &quot;</span>));\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">getBreadcrumbs</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;tools&quot;</span>).length, ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">getBreadcrumbs</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;zzz&quot;</span>).length);\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;parent of tools:&quot;</span>, ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">findNode</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;tools&quot;</span>).parent.title, <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;| root parent:&quot;</span>, ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">findNode</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;home&quot;</span>).parent);\n<span class=\"tok-k\">try</span> { <span class=\"tok-t\">JSON</span>.<span class=\"tok-f\">stringify</span>(<span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">select</span>()); } <span class=\"tok-k\">catch</span> (e) { console.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;stringify:&quot;</span>, e.constructor.name); }\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; [{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Home&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;/&quot;,&quot;children&quot;:[{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Products&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;/products&quot;,&quot;children&quot;:[{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Tools&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;/products/tools&quot;,&quot;children&quot;:[]},{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Garden&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;/products/garden&quot;,&quot;children&quot;:[]}]},{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;About&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;/about&quot;,&quot;children&quot;:[]}]}]</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; [ 'Products', 'About' ]</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; [ 'Products' ]</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; unknown start -&gt; [ 'Home' ]</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; Home &gt; Products &gt; Tools</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; 3 0</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; parent of tools: Products | root parent: undefined</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; stringify: TypeError</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"example-7-parameter-binding-from-controls-query-string-session-and-form\">Example 7: Parameter binding from controls, query string, session and form<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#example-7-parameter-binding-from-controls-query-string-session-and-form\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span class=\"code-lang\">ts</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\">Copy</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-ts\"><span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> { <span class=\"tok-t\">ParameterCollection</span>, <span class=\"tok-t\">Parameter</span>, <span class=\"tok-t\">ControlParameter</span>, <span class=\"tok-t\">QueryStringParameter</span>,\n         <span class=\"tok-t\">SessionParameter</span>, <span class=\"tok-t\">FormParameter</span>, <span class=\"tok-t\">ObjectDataSource</span> } <span class=\"tok-k\">from</span> <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;@wf-controls/core&quot;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> ps = <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">ParameterCollection</span>([\n  <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">ControlParameter</span>({ name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;cat&quot;</span>, controlId: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;ddlCat&quot;</span>, propertyName: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;selectedValue&quot;</span>, defaultValue: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;All&quot;</span> }),\n  <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">ControlParameter</span>({ name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;q&quot;</span>, controlId: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;txtSearch&quot;</span> }),   <span class=\"tok-c\">// control registered as a getter function</span>\n  <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">QueryStringParameter</span>({ name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;page&quot;</span>, queryStringField: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;page&quot;</span>, <span class=\"tok-k\">type</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Int32&quot;</span>, defaultValue: <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span> }),\n  <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">QueryStringParameter</span>({ name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;debug&quot;</span>, queryStringField: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;debug&quot;</span>, <span class=\"tok-k\">type</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Boolean&quot;</span>, defaultValue: <span class=\"tok-k\">false</span> }),\n  <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">SessionParameter</span>({ name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;user&quot;</span>, sessionField: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;userName&quot;</span>, defaultValue: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;guest&quot;</span> }),\n  <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">FormParameter</span>({ name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;email&quot;</span>, formField: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;email&quot;</span> }),\n  <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">Parameter</span>({ name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;since&quot;</span>, <span class=\"tok-k\">type</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;DateTime&quot;</span>, defaultValue: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;2024-01-31T00:00:00Z&quot;</span> }),\n  <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">Parameter</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;flag&quot;</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;x&quot;</span>)\n]);\n<span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> ctx = {\n  controls: { ddlCat: { selectedValue: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Tools&quot;</span> }, txtSearch: () =&gt; <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;hammer&quot;</span> },\n  queryString: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;?page=3&amp;debug=yes&quot;</span>,\n  session: { userName: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;ada&quot;</span> },\n  form: { email: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;ada@example.com&quot;</span> }\n};\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(ps.<span class=\"tok-f\">evaluate</span>(ctx));\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;empty ctx:&quot;</span>, ps.<span class=\"tok-f\">evaluate</span>({}));\nps.<span class=\"tok-k\">get</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;cat&quot;</span>).value = <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Garden&quot;</span>;                 <span class=\"tok-c\">// explicit value beats the control</span>\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;override:&quot;</span>, ps.<span class=\"tok-f\">evaluate</span>(ctx).cat);\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> ds = <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">ObjectDataSource</span>({ id: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;o&quot;</span>, typeInstance: { go: (p) =&gt; p }, selectMethod: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;go&quot;</span>, selectParameters: ps });\nds.parameterContext = ctx;\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">select</span>());\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; { cat: 'Tools', q: 'hammer', page: 3, debug: true, user: 'ada', email: 'ada@example.com',</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt;   since: 2024-01-31T00:00:00.000Z, flag: 'x' }</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; empty ctx: { cat: 'All', q: undefined, page: 1, debug: false, user: 'guest', email: undefined,</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt;   since: 2024-01-31T00:00:00.000Z, flag: 'x' }</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; override: Garden</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; { cat: 'Garden', q: 'hammer', page: 3, debug: true, user: 'ada', email: 'ada@example.com',</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt;   since: 2024-01-31T00:00:00.000Z, flag: 'x' }</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>(Verified output is multi-line; reflowed here.) Also verified: <code>FormData</code>, <code>URLSearchParams</code>, <code>{ p: &quot;8&quot; }</code> plain objects, and a <code>{ getItem }</code> storage-like object all work as context sources.</p>\n<h3 id=\"example-8-events---parameter-injection-cancel-error-handling\">Example 8: Events - parameter injection, cancel, error handling<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#example-8-events---parameter-injection-cancel-error-handling\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span class=\"code-lang\">ts</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\">Copy</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-ts\"><span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> { <span class=\"tok-t\">SqlDataSource</span> } <span class=\"tok-k\">from</span> <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;@wf-controls/core&quot;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> ds = <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">SqlDataSource</span>({\n  id: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;Ev&quot;</span>, selectCommand: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;s&quot;</span>, insertCommand: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;i&quot;</span>, updateCommand: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;u&quot;</span>, deleteCommand: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;d&quot;</span>,\n  handler: <span class=\"tok-k\">async</span> (cmd, p, op) =&gt; { <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> (cmd === <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;boom&quot;</span>) <span class=\"tok-k\">throw</span> <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;string failure&quot;</span>; <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> op === <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;select&quot;</span> ? [<span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>, <span class=\"tok-n\">2</span>, <span class=\"tok-n\">3</span>] : <span class=\"tok-n\">5</span>; }\n});\n<span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> log = [];\nds.inserting.<span class=\"tok-f\">subscribe</span>((_s, e) =&gt; { e.values.createdBy = <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;system&quot;</span>; log.<span class=\"tok-f\">push</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;inserting &quot;</span> + <span class=\"tok-t\">JSON</span>.<span class=\"tok-f\">stringify</span>(e.values)); });\nds.inserted.<span class=\"tok-f\">subscribe</span>((_s, e) =&gt; log.<span class=\"tok-f\">push</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;inserted rows=&quot;</span> + e.affectedRows + <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot; ret=&quot;</span> + e.returnValue));\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">insert</span>({ name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;x&quot;</span> }), log);\n\nds.updating.<span class=\"tok-f\">subscribe</span>((_s, e) =&gt; { <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> (e.values.locked) e.cancel = <span class=\"tok-k\">true</span>; });\nconsole.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;cancelled update:&quot;</span>, <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">update</span>({ id: <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span> }, { locked: <span class=\"tok-k\">true</span> }));\n\nds.selecting.<span class=\"tok-f\">subscribe</span>((_s, e) =&gt; { e.parameters.tenant = <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;t1&quot;</span>; });\nds.selected.<span class=\"tok-f\">subscribe</span>((_s, e) =&gt; console.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;selected&quot;</span>, e.data, e.totalRowCount));\n<span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">select</span>();\n\nds.insertCommand = <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;boom&quot;</span>;\n<span class=\"tok-k\">try</span> { <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">insert</span>({}); } <span class=\"tok-k\">catch</span> (e) { console.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;unhandled:&quot;</span>, e <span class=\"tok-k\">instanceof</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">Error</span>, e.message); }\n<span class=\"tok-k\">try</span> { <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">SqlDataSource</span>({ id: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;x&quot;</span> }).<span class=\"tok-f\">select</span>(); } <span class=\"tok-k\">catch</span> (e) { console.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(e.message); }\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; 5 [ 'inserting {&quot;name&quot;:&quot;x&quot;,&quot;createdBy&quot;:&quot;system&quot;}', 'inserted rows=5 ret=5' ]</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; cancelled update: 0</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; selected [ 1, 2, 3 ] 3</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; unhandled: true string failure</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; SqlDataSource 'x' has no selectCommand configured.</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>The handler returned <code>5</code>, so <code>affectedRows</code> is <code>5</code>; a thrown string is wrapped in an <code>Error</code>.</p>\n<h3 id=\"example-9-custom-parameter-precedence-and-defaults-declared-vs-injected-paging\">Example 9: Custom <code>Parameter</code> precedence and defaults (declared vs injected paging)<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#example-9-custom-parameter-precedence-and-defaults-declared-vs-injected-paging\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span class=\"code-lang\">ts</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\">Copy</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-ts\"><span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> { <span class=\"tok-t\">SqlDataSource</span>, <span class=\"tok-t\">Parameter</span> } <span class=\"tok-k\">from</span> <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;@wf-controls/core&quot;</span>;\nglobalThis.fetch = <span class=\"tok-k\">async</span> (url, init) =&gt; { console.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(init.method, url); <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">Response</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;[]&quot;</span>); };\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">const</span> ds = <span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">SqlDataSource</span>({\n  id: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;a&quot;</span>, selectCommand: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;GET /x&quot;</span>,\n  selectParameters: [<span class=\"tok-k\">new</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">Parameter</span>({ name: <span class=\"tok-s\">&quot;maximumRows&quot;</span>, defaultValue: <span class=\"tok-n\">2</span> })]\n});\n<span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> ds.<span class=\"tok-f\">select</span>({ maximumRows: <span class=\"tok-n\">99</span> });\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// -&gt; GET /x?maximumRows=2     (declared parameter wins over selectArgs in SqlDataSource)</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>In <code>ObjectDataSource</code> with <code>enablePaging: true</code> the opposite holds: <code>selectArgs.maximumRows</code> would overwrite the declared parameter.</p>\n<hr>\n"},"gotchas-and-limitations-summary":{"overview":"<ul><li>No caching, <code>ConvertEmptyStringToNull</code>, <code>CancelSelectOnNullParameter</code>, parameter <code>Direction</code>/<code>Size</code> handling, or <code>Cookie</code>/<code>Profile</code>/<code>Route</code> parameters.</li><li><code>DataSourceSelectArguments.retrieveTotalRowCount</code> and <code>totalRowCount</code> are never used; read <code>selected.totalRowCount</code>.</li><li><code>selectCommandType</code>, <code>typeName</code>, <code>dataFilePath</code> are stored but inert.</li><li><code>select</code> errors are never wrapped and do not raise <code>selected</code>; write errors are routed through <code>inserted</code> / <code>updated</code> / <code>deleted</code> (SQL and Object) and rethrown unless <code>exceptionHandled</code>. Access, Xml and SiteMap never populate <code>exception</code>.</li><li><code>SqlDataSource</code> treats <code>&quot;WORD something&quot;</code> commands as <code>METHOD url</code>; plain SQL needs a <code>handler</code>.</li><li><code>deleting</code> exposes no parameter bag: you cannot alter a delete through the event in <code>SqlDataSource</code>.</li><li><code>XmlDataSource</code> XPath reduces to the first path segment; the Node fallback parser is lossy (see section 8.4).</li><li><code>SiteMapDataSource</code> mutates input nodes to add <code>parent</code> (circular), ignores <code>roles</code>, and only links parents in the constructor.</li><li><code>AccessDataSource</code> matches keys with <code>===</code>, and an empty <code>keys</code> object matches every row; each write calls <code>acceptChanges()</code>.</li></ul>"}};
export default area;
